window.WRITING=[{"title":"Artificial intelligence is increasingly becoming part of our daily lives. Some people believe AI will greatly improve human life, while others worry it may cause more problems. Write an essay expressing your opinion on the impact of AI on society.","cn":"人工智能正日益融入我们的日常生活。有人认为人工智能将极大改善人类生活，也有人担心它可能带来更多问题。请写一篇文章，表达你对人工智能影响社会的看法。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段引出现象并表明立场","第二段用2-3个论点支撑观点，可举例","第三段总结观点，给出展望或建议"],"phrases":[{"en":"revolutionize the way we live and work","cn":"彻底改变我们的生活方式和工作方式"},{"en":"raise concerns about","cn":"引发对……的担忧"},{"en":"enhance efficiency and productivity","cn":"提高效率和生产力"},{"en":"pose a threat to","cn":"对……构成威胁"},{"en":"strike a balance between","cn":"在……之间取得平衡"},{"en":"harness the power of","cn":"利用……的力量"},{"en":"ethical considerations","cn":"伦理方面的考量"},{"en":"indispensable tool","cn":"不可或缺的工具"}],"sents":["There is no denying that artificial intelligence has become ________ in modern society.","It is widely acknowledged that AI can significantly enhance efficiency and productivity.","From my perspective, the advantages of AI outweigh its potential drawbacks.","However, we should remain vigilant about the ethical issues it may raise.","Only by striking a proper balance can we truly harness the power of AI for the benefit of humanity."],"essay":"Artificial intelligence has rapidly transformed various aspects of our daily lives, from smart home devices to autonomous vehicles. While some people welcome this technological revolution with open arms, others express concerns about its potential risks. From my perspective, AI brings more benefits than challenges, provided that we manage its development responsibly.\n\nOn the one hand, AI has greatly enhanced efficiency and productivity across numerous fields. In healthcare, AI-powered diagnostic tools can detect diseases earlier and more accurately than traditional methods. In education, personalized learning platforms adapt to individual students’ needs, making learning more effective. Moreover, AI automates repetitive tasks in manufacturing and logistics, freeing people to focus on creative and strategic work. These advancements have undeniably improved the quality of life for many people around the world.\n\nOn the other hand, legitimate concerns about AI cannot be ignored. Job displacement in certain industries and privacy violations are real issues that require serious attention. Nevertheless, I believe that through proper regulation and ethical guidelines, we can mitigate these risks while continuing to enjoy the remarkable benefits that AI offers to society.","essayCn":"人工智能迅速改变着我们日常生活的方方面面，从智能家居设备到自动驾驶汽车。有些人张开双臂欢迎这场技术革命，而另一些人则对其潜在风险表示担忧。在我看来，只要我们负责任地管理其发展，人工智能带来的利大于弊。\n\n一方面，人工智能极大地提高了众多领域的效率和生产力。在医疗保健领域，人工智能辅助诊断工具能够比传统方法更早、更准确地检测疾病。在教育领域，个性化学习平台根据学生的个体需求进行调整，使学习更加高效。此外，人工智能自动化了制造业和物流业中的重复性任务，使人们能够专注于创造性和战略性工作。这些进步无疑改善了世界各地许多人的生活质量。\n\n另一方面，对人工智能的合理担忧也不容忽视。某些行业的就业岗位流失和隐私侵犯是需要认真关注的现实问题。然而，我相信通过适当的监管和伦理准则，我们可以在继续享受人工智能带来的显著益处的同时，有效降低这些风险。"},{"title":"In recent years, many cities have implemented policies to reduce the use of single-use plastics. Write an essay analyzing this trend and expressing your views on how individuals can contribute to environmental protection.","cn":"近年来，许多城市实施了减少一次性塑料使用的政策。请写一篇文章分析这一趋势，并就个人如何为环境保护做出贡献表达你的看法。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段描述限塑背景和现象","第二段分析个人可以采取的环保行动","第三段总结并呼吁全社会共同参与"],"phrases":[{"en":"growing awareness of environmental issues","cn":"日益增强的环保意识"},{"en":"take immediate action to","cn":"立即采取行动来"},{"en":"reduce our carbon footprint","cn":"减少我们的碳足迹"},{"en":"play a vital role in","cn":"在……中发挥重要作用"},{"en":"adopt a sustainable lifestyle","cn":"采取可持续的生活方式"},{"en":"minimize waste","cn":"最大限度地减少浪费"},{"en":"eco-friendly alternatives","cn":"环保的替代品"},{"en":"collective effort","cn":"共同努力"}],"sents":["With the growing awareness of environmental issues, it is imperative that we ________.","Every individual should play a vital role in protecting our planet.","By adopting a sustainable lifestyle, we can significantly reduce our carbon footprint.","It is high time that the government and citizens joined hands to ________.","Small changes in our daily habits can make a tremendous difference to the environment."],"essay":"Environmental protection has become one of the most pressing issues of our time. In recent years, numerous cities have introduced regulations to limit single-use plastics, reflecting a growing public awareness of the damage caused by plastic pollution. This positive trend demonstrates that both governments and individuals are beginning to take environmental responsibility seriously.\n\nAs individuals, there are many practical steps we can take to contribute to environmental protection. First, we should adopt sustainable habits such as carrying reusable shopping bags and water bottles to minimize waste in our daily routines. Second, choosing public transportation, cycling, or walking instead of driving private cars can significantly reduce our carbon footprint and improve air quality. Third, we can participate in community clean-up activities and encourage friends and family to adopt eco-friendly alternatives in their everyday lives. Even small actions, when practiced consistently, can produce meaningful results.\n\nIn conclusion, environmental protection is not solely the responsibility of governments or corporations; every individual plays a vital role. By making conscious choices and taking small but consistent actions, we can collectively create a cleaner, greener, and more sustainable world for future generations.","essayCn":"环境保护已成为当今时代最紧迫的问题之一。近年来，许多城市出台了限制一次性塑料的法规，反映出公众对塑料污染危害的认识日益增强。这一积极趋势表明，政府和个人都开始认真对待环境责任。\n\n作为个人，我们可以采取许多切实可行的步骤为环境保护做出贡献。首先，我们应养成可持续的习惯，如携带可重复使用的购物袋和水壶，以最大限度地减少日常生活中的浪费。其次，选择公共交通、骑自行车或步行代替驾驶私家车可以显著减少我们的碳足迹并改善空气质量。第三，我们可以参加社区清洁活动，并鼓励朋友和家人在日常生活中采用环保的替代品。即使是小小的行动，只要坚持实践，也能产生有意义的成果。\n\n总之，环境保护不仅仅是政府或企业的责任，每个人都发挥着重要作用。通过有意识地选择和持续采取虽小但一致的行动，我们可以共同为子孙后代创造一个更清洁、更绿色、更可持续的世界。"},{"title":"Some people argue that online education will eventually replace traditional classroom teaching, while others believe face-to-face interaction in classrooms is irreplaceable. Discuss both views and give your opinion.","cn":"有些人认为在线教育最终将取代传统课堂教学，而另一些人认为课堂中面对面的互动是不可替代的。请讨论双方观点并给出你的看法。","type":"对比选择","tips":["第一段引出在线教育和传统教育的争议","第二段分别讨论两种教育方式的优势和不足","第三段给出自己的观点，可以支持结合两者"],"phrases":[{"en":"gain increasing popularity","cn":"越来越受欢迎"},{"en":"offer unparalleled flexibility","cn":"提供无与伦比的灵活性"},{"en":"lack face-to-face interaction","cn":"缺乏面对面的互动"},{"en":"foster critical thinking skills","cn":"培养批判性思维能力"},{"en":"a complementary approach","cn":"一种互补的方式"},{"en":"break down geographical barriers","cn":"打破地理障碍"},{"en":"cultivate interpersonal skills","cn":"培养人际交往能力"},{"en":"combine the best of both worlds","cn":"兼取两者之长"}],"sents":["The debate over whether online education can replace traditional classrooms has intensified in recent years.","While online learning offers unparalleled flexibility, it cannot entirely replace the benefits of face-to-face interaction.","Traditional classrooms provide a structured environment that helps cultivate interpersonal skills and teamwork.","A blended approach that combines online and offline learning may be the most effective solution.","Ultimately, education should focus on combining the best of both worlds to maximize student outcomes."],"essay":"The rapid development of technology has sparked a heated debate about the future of education. Some argue that online learning will eventually replace traditional classrooms, while others insist that face-to-face teaching remains essential. Both perspectives have valid points worth considering.\n\nOnline education offers unparalleled flexibility and convenience. Students can access courses from anywhere, breaking down geographical barriers and allowing them to learn at their own pace. Digital resources such as video lectures and interactive quizzes also make learning more engaging. However, online learning often lacks the personal interaction that is crucial for developing communication and teamwork skills. Traditional classrooms, on the other hand, provide a structured environment where teachers can observe students’ reactions, offer immediate feedback, and foster critical thinking through lively discussions. The social atmosphere of a physical classroom also helps students build friendships and cultivate interpersonal skills that are essential for their future careers.\n\nIn my opinion, neither approach alone is sufficient. The ideal solution is to combine the best of both worlds by adopting a blended learning model that integrates the convenience of online resources with the irreplaceable value of in-person interaction, thereby maximizing educational outcomes.","essayCn":"科技的快速发展引发了一场关于教育未来的激烈辩论。有人认为在线学习最终将取代传统课堂，而另一些人则坚持面对面教学仍然不可或缺。两种观点都有值得考虑的道理。\n\n在线教育提供了无与伦比的灵活性和便利性。学生可以随时随地访问课程，打破了地理障碍，并使他们能够按照自己的节奏学习。视频讲座和互动测验等数字资源也使学习变得更加引人入胜。然而，在线学习往往缺乏对发展沟通和团队协作能力至关重要的个人互动。另一方面，传统课堂提供了一个结构化的环境，教师可以观察学生的反应，提供即时反馈，并通过活跃的讨论培养批判性思维。实体课堂的社交氛围也帮助学生建立友谊，培养对未来职业至关重要的人际交往能力。\n\n在我看来，单独使用哪种方式都不够充分。理想的解决方案是兼取两者之长，采用混合学习模式，将在线资源的便利性与面对面互动的不可替代价值相结合，从而最大限度地提高教育效果。"},{"title":"An increasing number of college graduates are choosing to start their own businesses instead of seeking traditional employment. Write an essay discussing the advantages and challenges of youth entrepreneurship.","cn":"越来越多的大学毕业生选择自主创业而不是寻找传统就业。请写一篇文章讨论青年创业的优势和挑战。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段描述大学生创业的现象","第二段分析创业的优势和挑战","第三段给出建议或总结"],"phrases":[{"en":"pursue entrepreneurial dreams","cn":"追求创业梦想"},{"en":"fierce job market competition","cn":"激烈的就业市场竞争"},{"en":"face numerous challenges","cn":"面临诸多挑战"},{"en":"cultivate innovation and resilience","cn":"培养创新和韧性"},{"en":"secure financial support","cn":"获得资金支持"},{"en":"accumulate practical experience","cn":"积累实践经验"},{"en":"a double-edged sword","cn":"一把双刃剑"},{"en":"lay a solid foundation","cn":"打下坚实的基础"}],"sents":["An increasing number of college graduates are choosing to pursue entrepreneurial dreams rather than seeking traditional employment.","Youth entrepreneurship is a double-edged sword that brings both opportunities and challenges.","It is undeniable that starting a business can cultivate innovation and resilience in young people.","However, limited capital and lack of experience may prevent many young entrepreneurs from succeeding.","To encourage youth entrepreneurship, the government and universities should provide more support and guidance."],"essay":"In recent years, a growing number of college graduates have chosen entrepreneurship over traditional employment. This trend reflects both the fierce competition in the job market and young people’s desire to pursue their own visions. While youth entrepreneurship presents exciting opportunities, it also comes with significant challenges.\n\nOn the positive side, starting a business allows young graduates to cultivate innovation and resilience. Entrepreneurs gain hands-on experience in management, marketing, and problem-solving, skills that are invaluable regardless of their future career path. Moreover, successful startups can create jobs and contribute to economic growth. However, young entrepreneurs often face numerous challenges, including limited access to capital, insufficient practical experience, and the pressure of managing a business without a safety net. Many startups fail within the first few years due to these obstacles, and the emotional toll of failure can be considerable.\n\nTo address these challenges, it is essential that universities and the government work together to provide mentorship programs, funding opportunities, and practical training. By laying a solid foundation for young entrepreneurs, we can help them turn their innovative ideas into successful ventures that benefit both themselves and society.","essayCn":"近年来，越来越多的大学毕业生选择了创业而非传统就业。这一趋势既反映了就业市场的激烈竞争，也体现了年轻人追求自己愿景的愿望。虽然青年创业带来了令人兴奋的机会，但也伴随着重大挑战。\n\n从积极的方面来看，创业能让年轻毕业生培养创新和韧性。创业者在管理、营销和解决问题方面获得宝贵的实践经验，这些技能无论未来的职业道路如何都是无价的。此外，成功的初创企业能够创造就业机会，促进经济增长。然而，年轻创业者经常面临诸多挑战，包括获得资金的渠道有限、实践经验不足，以及在没有安全网的情况下管理企业的压力。由于这些障碍，许多初创企业在头几年内就失败了，失败带来的情感负担也可能相当沉重。\n\n为了应对这些挑战，大学和政府必须共同努力，提供导师计划、资金机会和实际培训。通过为年轻创业者打下坚实的基础，我们可以帮助他们将创新想法转化为成功的事业，既造福自身，也造福社会。"},{"title":"Write a letter to the university president suggesting ways to promote traditional Chinese culture on campus. Your letter should include at least three specific suggestions and explain why they are important.","cn":"请写一封信给大学校长，建议在校园内推广中国传统文化的方案。你的信应包含至少三个具体建议，并解释其重要性。","type":"应用文","tips":["第一段说明写信目的","第二段提出具体建议并阐述原因","第三段表达期望并礼貌结束"],"phrases":[{"en":"preserve and promote cultural heritage","cn":"保护和推广文化遗产"},{"en":"organize cultural festivals","cn":"组织文化节活动"},{"en":"offer elective courses on","cn":"开设关于……的选修课程"},{"en":"invite renowned experts to give lectures","cn":"邀请知名专家做讲座"},{"en":"foster a sense of cultural identity","cn":"培养文化认同感"},{"en":"enrich campus life","cn":"丰富校园生活"},{"en":"pass down cultural traditions","cn":"传承文化传统"},{"en":"I would greatly appreciate it if","cn":"如果您能……我将不胜感激"}],"sents":["I am writing to suggest several measures to promote traditional Chinese culture on our campus.","It is of great significance to organize activities that help students appreciate our cultural heritage.","I believe that offering elective courses on traditional arts would greatly enrich students' understanding of Chinese culture.","I would greatly appreciate it if you could consider these suggestions.","I sincerely hope that our university will take the lead in preserving and promoting cultural traditions."],"essay":"Dear President,\n\nI am a student at our university, and I am writing to respectfully suggest several measures that could help promote traditional Chinese culture on our campus. As globalization continues to influence our daily lives, it is increasingly important to preserve and promote our cultural heritage among young people.\n\nFirst, I recommend organizing annual cultural festivals that showcase traditional arts such as calligraphy, paper cutting, and Chinese opera. These events would enrich campus life and foster a stronger sense of cultural identity among students. Second, the university could offer elective courses on Chinese philosophy, history, and traditional medicine, allowing students to explore the depth of our cultural traditions in an academic setting. Third, inviting renowned scholars and artisans to deliver guest lectures would provide students with invaluable firsthand insights into traditional practices and inspire them to appreciate the wisdom of our ancestors.\n\nI believe these initiatives would not only deepen students’ appreciation of traditional Chinese culture but also strengthen their confidence as members of a civilization with a rich history. I would greatly appreciate it if you could consider these suggestions.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essayCn":"尊敬的校长：\n\n我是本校的一名学生，写此信是想恭敬地提出几项建议，以帮助在校园内推广中国传统文化。随着全球化持续影响我们的日常生活，在年轻人中保护和推广文化遗产变得愈发重要。\n\n首先，我建议组织年度文化节，展示书法、剪纸和中国戏曲等传统艺术。这些活动将丰富校园生活，增强学生的文化认同感。其次，大学可以开设中国哲学、历史和传统医学方面的选修课程，让学生在学术环境中深入探索我们文化传统的精髓。第三，邀请知名学者和工匠举办客座讲座，将为学生提供宝贵的关于传统技艺的第一手见解，并激励他们欣赏祖先的智慧。\n\n我相信这些举措不仅能加深学生对中国传统文化的理解，也将增强他们作为一个拥有丰富历史的文明成员的自信心。如果您能考虑这些建议，我将不胜感激。\n\n此致敬意，\n李明"},{"title":"Short video platforms have become increasingly popular among young people. Some believe they provide valuable entertainment and learning opportunities, while others argue they are addictive and harmful. Write an essay analyzing this phenomenon.","cn":"短视频平台在年轻人中越来越受欢迎。有人认为它们提供了有价值的娱乐和学习机会，而另一些人则认为它们令人上瘾且有害。请写一篇文章分析这一现象。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段描述短视频流行的现象","第二段分析其积极和消极影响","第三段提出合理使用短视频的建议"],"phrases":[{"en":"become an integral part of","cn":"成为……不可分割的一部分"},{"en":"provide bite-sized content","cn":"提供简短精炼的内容"},{"en":"be addicted to","cn":"沉迷于"},{"en":"fragment one's attention span","cn":"碎片化某人的注意力"},{"en":"exercise self-discipline","cn":"加强自律"},{"en":"a wealth of information","cn":"大量信息"},{"en":"spend excessive time on","cn":"在……上花费过多时间"},{"en":"set reasonable time limits","cn":"设定合理的时间限制"}],"sents":["Short video platforms have become an integral part of young people's daily lives.","While these platforms offer a wealth of information, excessive use can seriously affect one's health and productivity.","It is essential that young people exercise self-discipline and set reasonable time limits on screen time.","The fragmentation of information may prevent users from developing deep thinking skills.","Only by using short videos wisely can we truly benefit from this technological innovation."],"essay":"In recent years, short video platforms have gained enormous popularity, especially among young people. With just a few swipes, users can access endless streams of entertaining and educational content. While these platforms offer undeniable benefits, their potential negative effects deserve serious attention.\n\nOn the positive side, short videos provide bite-sized content that makes learning more accessible and enjoyable. Many creators share knowledge about science, history, and practical skills in an engaging format, reaching audiences that traditional education might not. However, the addictive nature of short videos is a growing concern. Many young people spend excessive time scrolling through content, which can fragment their attention span and reduce their ability to focus on longer, more complex tasks. Furthermore, prolonged screen time may lead to health issues such as poor eyesight and sleep disturbances.\n\nTo address these problems, it is essential that users exercise self-discipline and set reasonable time limits for daily video consumption. Parents and educators should also guide young people in developing healthy media habits. By using short videos wisely and moderately, we can enjoy their benefits while minimizing their drawbacks.","essayCn":"近年来，短视频平台获得了极大的欢迎，尤其在年轻人中。只需滑动几下，用户就能获取无尽的娱乐和教育内容。虽然这些平台提供了不可否认的好处，但其潜在的负面影响值得严肃关注。\n\n从积极方面来看，短视频提供简短精炼的内容，使学习变得更加便捷和有趣。许多创作者以引人入胜的方式分享科学、历史和实用技能方面的知识，触及传统教育可能无法达到的受众。然而，短视频的成瘾性日益令人担忧。许多年轻人花大量时间浏览内容，这可能会碎片化他们的注意力，降低他们专注于更长时间、更复杂任务的能力。此外，长时间使用屏幕可能导致视力下降和睡眠障碍等健康问题。\n\n为了解决这些问题，用户必须加强自律，为每日视频观看设定合理的时间限制。家长和教育者也应引导年轻人养成健康的媒体使用习惯。通过明智、适度地使用短视频，我们可以在享受其益处的同时将弊端降到最低。"},{"title":"Mental health issues among young people have attracted widespread attention in recent years. Write an essay discussing the causes of this problem and proposing possible solutions.","cn":"近年来，年轻人的心理健康问题引起了广泛关注。请写一篇文章讨论这一问题的原因并提出可能的解决方案。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段引出心理健康问题的现象和严重性","第二段分析主要原因","第三段提出解决方案并总结"],"phrases":[{"en":"a pressing social issue","cn":"一个紧迫的社会问题"},{"en":"academic pressure and competition","cn":"学业压力和竞争"},{"en":"suffer from anxiety and depression","cn":"遭受焦虑和抑郁的困扰"},{"en":"raise public awareness of","cn":"提高公众对……的意识"},{"en":"seek professional help","cn":"寻求专业帮助"},{"en":"create a supportive environment","cn":"创造一个支持性环境"},{"en":"break the stigma surrounding","cn":"打破围绕……的污名"},{"en":"promote emotional well-being","cn":"促进情感健康"}],"sents":["Mental health issues among young people have become a pressing social issue that cannot be ignored.","It is universally acknowledged that academic pressure and social expectations are major contributing factors.","Schools and families should work together to create a supportive environment for young people.","It is essential to break the stigma surrounding mental illness and encourage those in need to seek professional help.","Only by raising public awareness can we effectively promote emotional well-being among the younger generation."],"essay":"Mental health has become a topic of increasing concern in modern society, particularly among young people. Studies show that the number of students suffering from anxiety and depression has risen significantly in recent years. This pressing issue demands our immediate attention and concerted efforts to find effective solutions.\n\nSeveral factors contribute to the growing mental health crisis among young people. First, intense academic pressure and fierce competition for limited resources create enormous stress. Many students feel overwhelmed by the expectation to excel in exams, extracurricular activities, and social relationships simultaneously. Second, the widespread use of social media often leads to unhealthy comparisons and feelings of inadequacy. Young people are constantly exposed to carefully curated images of others' seemingly perfect lives, which can damage their self-esteem. Third, many families still fail to recognize the importance of emotional well-being, leaving young people without adequate support when they struggle.\n\nTo address this issue, multiple measures should be taken. Schools should provide accessible counseling services and incorporate mental health education into the curriculum. Families need to create open channels of communication where young people feel safe sharing their feelings. Society as a whole must work to break the stigma surrounding mental illness and encourage those in need to seek professional help without hesitation.","essayCn":"心理健康已成为现代社会日益关注的话题，尤其在年轻人中。研究表明，近年来遭受焦虑和抑郁困扰的学生人数显著增加。这一紧迫问题需要我们立即关注并共同努力寻找有效的解决方案。\n\n有几个因素导致了年轻人心理健康危机的加剧。首先，激烈的学业压力和对有限资源的激烈竞争造成了巨大的压力。许多学生因同时要在学习、课外活动和社交关系中表现出色的期望而感到不堪重负。其次，社交媒体的广泛使用常常导致不健康的攀比和自卑感。年轻人不断接触到他人精心修饰的看似完美生活的画面，这会损害他们的自尊。第三，许多家庭仍然未能认识到情感健康的重要性，使年轻人在困难时缺乏足够的支持。\n\n为了解决这一问题，应采取多项措施。学校应提供可及的心理咨询服务，并将心理健康教育纳入课程体系。家庭需要建立开放的沟通渠道，让年轻人感到安全地分享自己的感受。整个社会必须努力打破围绕心理疾病的污名，鼓励有需要的人毫不犹豫地寻求专业帮助。"},{"title":"In today's rapidly changing world, the concept of lifelong learning has become increasingly important. Write an essay discussing why continuous learning is essential and how people can achieve it.","cn":"在当今快速变化的世界中，终身学习的概念变得越来越重要。请写一篇文章讨论为什么持续学习至关重要以及人们如何实现终身学习。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段引出终身学习的必要性","第二段论述终身学习的好处和实现途径","第三段总结并鼓励持续学习"],"phrases":[{"en":"keep pace with the times","cn":"与时俱进"},{"en":"broaden one's horizons","cn":"拓宽视野"},{"en":"enhance career prospects","cn":"增强职业前景"},{"en":"take advantage of online resources","cn":"利用在线资源"},{"en":"foster a growth mindset","cn":"培养成长型思维"},{"en":"stay competitive in the job market","cn":"在就业市场中保持竞争力"},{"en":"pursue knowledge for its own sake","cn":"为知识本身而追求知识"},{"en":"adapt to the ever-changing world","cn":"适应不断变化的世界"}],"sents":["In an era of rapid technological advancement, lifelong learning is no longer optional but essential.","Continuous learning enables individuals to keep pace with the times and stay competitive in the job market.","Thanks to the Internet, people can take advantage of a vast array of online resources to acquire new skills.","Fostering a growth mindset is the key to embracing lifelong learning.","Only by committing to continuous self-improvement can we truly adapt to the ever-changing world."],"essay":"The twenty-first century is characterized by unprecedented changes in technology, economy, and society. In such a dynamic environment, the concept of lifelong learning has shifted from a luxury to a necessity. Continuous learning is essential for anyone who wishes to remain relevant, adaptable, and fulfilled in today's world.\n\nThere are compelling reasons why lifelong learning matters. First, it enables individuals to keep pace with rapid technological changes and stay competitive in the job market. As certain skills become obsolete, workers must constantly update their knowledge to meet evolving demands. Second, continuous learning broadens our horizons and enriches our lives intellectually. Whether through reading, attending workshops, or taking online courses, we can explore new subjects and develop diverse perspectives. Third, fostering a growth mindset through lifelong learning promotes personal development and emotional resilience. It encourages us to embrace challenges rather than avoid them.\n\nTo achieve lifelong learning, we should take advantage of the abundant resources available today. Online platforms offer courses on virtually every subject, making education accessible to people of all ages. Additionally, joining learning communities and engaging in discussions can deepen understanding and maintain motivation. In conclusion, lifelong learning is the key to thriving in an ever-changing world, and each of us should embrace it as a lifelong pursuit.","essayCn":"二十一世纪以技术、经济和社会前所未有的变革为特征。在这样一个充满活力的环境中，终身学习的概念已从一种奢侈品转变为一种必需。对于任何希望在当今世界保持与时俱进、适应力强和生活充实的人来说，持续学习都是必不可少的。\n\n终身学习之所以重要，有以下令人信服的理由。首先，它使个人能够跟上快速的技术变革，在就业市场中保持竞争力。随着某些技能变得过时，工作者必须不断更新知识以满足不断变化的需求。其次，持续学习拓宽我们的视野，在智识层面丰富我们的生活。无论是通过阅读、参加研讨会还是上在线课程，我们都可以探索新话题并发展多元视角。第三，通过终身学习培养成长型思维能促进个人发展和情感韧性。它鼓励我们拥抱挑战而非回避挑战。\n\n为了实现终身学习，我们应充分利用当今丰富的可用资源。在线平台提供几乎涵盖所有学科的课程，使教育对各年龄段的人都触手可及。此外，加入学习社区并参与讨论可以加深理解并保持动力。总之，终身学习是在不断变化的世界中蓬勃发展的关键，我们每个人都应将其作为一生的追求。"},{"title":"Some people prefer to live in big cities for the opportunities they offer, while others choose small towns or rural areas for a more peaceful life. Compare these two lifestyles and state your preference.","cn":"有些人喜欢住在大城市以获得更多机会，而另一些人选择小城镇或农村地区以过上更宁静的生活。请比较这两种生活方式并表明你的偏好。","type":"对比选择","tips":["第一段引出城市与乡村生活的对比话题","第二段对比两者的优缺点","第三段表达自己的偏好和理由"],"phrases":[{"en":"enjoy a higher standard of living","cn":"享受更高的生活水平"},{"en":"be confronted with heavy traffic","cn":"面临严重的交通问题"},{"en":"a slower pace of life","cn":"较慢的生活节奏"},{"en":"abundant job opportunities","cn":"丰富的就业机会"},{"en":"closer to nature","cn":"更接近大自然"},{"en":"suffer from noise and air pollution","cn":"遭受噪音和空气污染"},{"en":"strong sense of community","cn":"强烈的社区归属感"},{"en":"strike a balance between","cn":"在……之间取得平衡"}],"sents":["The choice between urban and rural living has long been a subject of debate.","While big cities offer abundant job opportunities, they are often accompanied by heavy traffic and pollution.","Small towns provide a slower pace of life and a stronger sense of community.","As far as I am concerned, the ideal living environment should strike a balance between convenience and tranquility.","Regardless of where we choose to live, what matters most is the quality of life we can achieve."],"essay":"The question of whether to live in a big city or a small town has been widely discussed. Urban areas and rural regions each offer distinct advantages and disadvantages, and the choice largely depends on individual priorities and lifestyle preferences.\n\nBig cities are known for their abundant job opportunities, world-class healthcare, and diverse cultural activities. Residents can enjoy a higher standard of living with convenient transportation and access to top educational institutions. However, city dwellers are often confronted with heavy traffic, noise, and air pollution. The high cost of living and intense competition can also lead to significant stress. In contrast, small towns and rural areas offer a slower pace of life, cleaner air, and a closer connection to nature. Communities tend to be tighter-knit, fostering a strong sense of belonging. Yet, rural areas may lack quality medical facilities, educational resources, and diverse career options.\n\nAs far as I am concerned, I would prefer to live in a medium-sized city that combines the convenience of urban amenities with the tranquility of a less crowded environment. Ultimately, the best choice is one that aligns with our personal values and allows us to lead a fulfilling and balanced life.","essayCn":"关于住在大城市还是小城镇的讨论一直非常广泛。城市地区和农村地区各有其独特的优缺点，选择在很大程度上取决于个人的优先考虑和生活方式偏好。\n\n大城市以其丰富的就业机会、世界级的医疗和多元的文化活动而闻名。居民可以享受更高的生活水平，拥有便利的交通和获取顶尖教育资源的渠道。然而，城市居民常常面临交通拥堵、噪音和空气污染。高昂的生活成本和激烈的竞争也可能导致巨大的压力。相比之下，小城镇和农村地区提供较慢的生活节奏、更清洁的空气和与大自然更紧密的联系。社区往往更加紧密团结，培养出强烈的归属感。但是，农村地区可能缺乏优质的医疗设施、教育资源和多元的职业选择。\n\n就我个人而言，我更愿意住在一个中等城市，既能享受城市便利设施，又能拥有不那么拥挤的宁静环境。最终，最好的选择是与我们的个人价值观相契合、能够让我们过上充实而平衡生活的那个。"},{"title":"Write an essay on the importance of volunteer work in society. You should discuss the benefits to both volunteers and the community, and encourage more people to participate.","cn":"请写一篇关于志愿工作在社会中的重要性的文章。你应讨论对志愿者和社区双方的益处，并鼓励更多人参与。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段引出志愿工作的重要性","第二段分别从志愿者和社区角度论述益处","第三段呼吁更多人参与志愿活动"],"phrases":[{"en":"contribute to the well-being of society","cn":"为社会福祉做贡献"},{"en":"develop a sense of social responsibility","cn":"培养社会责任感"},{"en":"bridge the gap between different social groups","cn":"缩小不同社会群体之间的差距"},{"en":"gain valuable practical experience","cn":"获得宝贵的实践经验"},{"en":"promote social harmony","cn":"促进社会和谐"},{"en":"make a positive difference","cn":"产生积极的影响"},{"en":"demonstrate compassion and generosity","cn":"展示同情心和慷慨"},{"en":"an indispensable part of","cn":"……不可缺少的组成部分"}],"sents":["Volunteer work plays an indispensable part in promoting social harmony and well-being.","By participating in volunteer activities, young people can develop a strong sense of social responsibility.","It is through selfless service that volunteers make a positive difference in their communities.","Volunteering not only benefits the recipients but also brings personal growth and satisfaction to the volunteers themselves.","More people should be encouraged to join volunteer programs and contribute to building a better society."],"essay":"Volunteer work is widely recognized as an indispensable part of a healthy and harmonious society. Through selfless service, volunteers contribute to the well-being of their communities while also experiencing personal growth. The importance of volunteer work cannot be overstated, as it benefits both the volunteers and the people they serve.\n\nFor volunteers, participating in community service offers numerous advantages. First, it helps them develop a strong sense of social responsibility and empathy. By working directly with people in need, volunteers gain a deeper understanding of social issues and learn to appreciate what they have. Second, volunteering provides valuable practical experience and helps develop skills such as communication, teamwork, and leadership, which are highly valued in both academic and professional settings. For the community, volunteers play a crucial role in addressing social challenges. They help organize educational programs for underprivileged children, provide care for elderly residents, and assist in environmental protection projects. Their efforts promote social harmony and bridge the gap between different social groups.\n\nIn conclusion, volunteer work demonstrates compassion and generosity while making a positive difference in society. I strongly encourage more people, especially young people, to participate in volunteer programs. Even small acts of kindness can create a ripple effect that transforms communities and inspires others to do the same.","essayCn":"志愿工作被公认为是健康和谐社会不可缺少的组成部分。通过无私的服务，志愿者在为社区福祉做出贡献的同时也经历了个人成长。志愿工作的重要性怎么强调都不为过，因为它同时造福了志愿者和他们服务的人群。\n\n对志愿者而言，参加社区服务提供了诸多好处。首先，它有助于培养强烈的社会责任感和同理心。通过与有需要的人直接合作，志愿者能够更深入地了解社会问题，并学会珍惜自己所拥有的。其次，志愿服务提供了宝贵的实践经验，有助于培养沟通、团队协作和领导力等技能，这些技能在学术和职业环境中都受到高度重视。对于社区来说，志愿者在应对社会挑战方面发挥着关键作用。他们帮助组织面向贫困儿童的教育项目，为老年居民提供照护，并协助环境保护项目。他们的努力促进了社会和谐，缩小了不同社会群体之间的差距。\n\n总之，志愿工作在产生积极社会影响的同时展示了同情心和慷慨。我强烈鼓励更多人，尤其是年轻人，参加志愿项目。即使是小小的善举也能产生连锁效应，改变社区并激励他人效仿。"},{"title":"Write an essay about how reading habits have changed in the digital age. Discuss both the positive and negative effects of these changes on individuals and society.","cn":"请写一篇文章谈谈在数字时代阅读习惯发生了怎样的变化。讨论这些变化对个人和社会的积极和消极影响。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段描述数字时代阅读习惯的变化","第二段分析积极和消极影响","第三段提出建议，引导健康阅读"],"phrases":[{"en":"undergo a dramatic transformation","cn":"经历巨大的转变"},{"en":"turn to digital devices for reading","cn":"转向数字设备进行阅读"},{"en":"access a vast library of information","cn":"获取海量信息"},{"en":"suffer from information overload","cn":"遭受信息过载"},{"en":"cultivate deep reading habits","cn":"培养深度阅读习惯"},{"en":"enhance reading efficiency","cn":"提高阅读效率"},{"en":"be easily distracted by","cn":"容易被……分散注意力"},{"en":"a balanced reading approach","cn":"一种平衡的阅读方式"}],"sents":["Reading habits have undergone a dramatic transformation with the widespread use of digital devices.","While digital reading enhances efficiency and convenience, it may also lead to shallower comprehension.","It is essential to cultivate deep reading habits alongside the convenience of digital technology.","A balanced reading approach that combines traditional and digital methods is highly recommended.","Only by being mindful of our reading choices can we truly benefit from the abundance of available information."],"essay":"The digital age has brought about a dramatic transformation in how people read. With smartphones, tablets, and e-readers becoming ubiquitous, more and more people are turning to digital devices for their daily reading. While this shift offers significant advantages, it also presents challenges that deserve our careful consideration.\n\nOn the positive side, digital reading allows people to access a vast library of information anytime and anywhere. E-books are often more affordable and portable than printed books, and search functions enable readers to find specific content quickly. Online platforms also facilitate interactive reading experiences through comments and discussions. However, there are notable drawbacks. The constant notifications and hyperlinks on digital devices can easily distract readers, leading to shallower comprehension. Moreover, the sheer volume of information available online may cause information overload, making it difficult for people to focus on any single text for an extended period. Research suggests that deep reading and critical thinking are better developed through traditional print reading.\n\nTo maximize the benefits of both formats, I recommend adopting a balanced reading approach. Readers should set aside dedicated time for deep reading with printed books while also taking advantage of digital resources for quick information gathering. By doing so, we can enjoy the best of both worlds in the digital age.","essayCn":"数字时代给人们的阅读方式带来了巨大的转变。随着智能手机、平板电脑和电子阅读器的普及，越来越多的人转向数字设备进行日常阅读。虽然这一转变提供了显著的优势，但也带来了值得我们仔细思考的挑战。\n\n从积极方面来看，数字阅读使人们能够随时随地获取海量信息。电子书通常比纸质书更实惠、更便携，搜索功能使读者能够快速找到特定内容。在线平台还通过评论和讨论促进了互动式的阅读体验。然而，也存在明显的缺点。数字设备上不断弹出的通知和超链接很容易分散读者的注意力，导致理解变得浅薄。此外，在线可获取的信息量之大可能导致信息过载，使人们难以长时间专注于任何单一文本。研究表明，深度阅读和批判性思维通过传统纸质阅读能得到更好的发展。\n\n为了最大化两种格式的优势，我建议采用平衡的阅读方式。读者应该留出专门时间用纸质书进行深度阅读，同时也利用数字资源快速收集信息。通过这样做，我们可以在数字时代兼享两者之长。"},{"title":"Effective time management is a crucial skill for success in both academic and professional life. Write an essay discussing why time management is important and share some practical strategies for managing time well.","cn":"有效的时间管理是在学业和职业生活中取得成功的关键技能。请写一篇文章讨论时间管理为何重要，并分享一些有效管理时间的实用策略。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段阐述时间管理的重要性","第二段分享具体的时间管理策略","第三段总结并鼓励养成良好习惯"],"phrases":[{"en":"make the most of our time","cn":"充分利用我们的时间"},{"en":"set clear priorities","cn":"设定明确的优先级"},{"en":"procrastinate on important tasks","cn":"拖延重要任务"},{"en":"create a detailed schedule","cn":"制定详细的计划"},{"en":"achieve a better work-life balance","cn":"实现更好的工作与生活的平衡"},{"en":"allocate time wisely","cn":"合理分配时间"},{"en":"avoid the trap of multitasking","cn":"避免多任务处理的陷阱"},{"en":"a key factor in determining","cn":"决定……的一个关键因素"}],"sents":["Time management is widely regarded as a key factor in determining one's success in both academic and professional life.","It is advisable to create a detailed schedule and allocate time wisely among various tasks.","By setting clear priorities, we can avoid the common trap of procrastinating on important tasks.","We should learn to avoid the trap of multitasking and instead focus on one task at a time.","Mastering time management skills will ultimately help us achieve a better work-life balance and greater overall success."],"essay":"Time is one of the most valuable resources we possess, yet many people struggle to use it wisely. Effective time management is a key factor in determining success in both academic and professional settings. Those who master this skill tend to be more productive, less stressed, and better able to achieve their goals.\n\nThere are several practical strategies for managing time effectively. First, it is essential to set clear priorities by distinguishing between urgent and important tasks. The Eisenhower Matrix is a useful tool that helps us categorize tasks and focus on what truly matters. Second, creating a detailed daily or weekly schedule enables us to allocate time wisely and ensures that no critical deadlines are overlooked. Third, we should avoid the trap of multitasking, as research has shown that focusing on one task at a time leads to higher quality work and greater efficiency. Additionally, setting specific, measurable goals provides direction and motivation, while regular breaks prevent burnout and maintain concentration.\n\nIn conclusion, effective time management is not an innate talent but a learnable skill that anyone can develop with practice. By setting priorities, planning schedules, and maintaining focus, we can make the most of our time and achieve a better work-life balance. Start today, and you will soon notice a remarkable improvement in both your productivity and well-being.","essayCn":"时间是我们拥有的最宝贵的资源之一，然而许多人难以明智地利用它。有效的时间管理是决定学业和职业环境成功与否的关键因素。掌握这项技能的人往往更加高效、压力更小，也更能实现自己的目标。\n\n有几个有效管理时间的实用策略。首先，必须通过区分紧急和重要的任务来设定明确的优先级。艾森豪威尔矩阵是一个有用的工具，帮助我们分类任务并专注于真正重要的事情。其次，制定详细的每日或每周计划使我们能够合理分配时间，确保不遗漏任何关键截止日期。第三，我们应避免多任务处理的陷阱，因为研究表明一次专注于一项任务能带来更高质量的工作和更高的效率。此外，设定具体的、可衡量的目标提供方向和动力，而定期休息可以防止倦怠并保持专注力。\n\n总之，有效的时间管理不是天生的才能，而是任何人都可以通过练习培养的可学习技能。通过设定优先级、规划日程和保持专注，我们可以充分利用时间，实现更好的工作与生活平衡。从今天开始，你很快就会注意到生产力和幸福感的显著提升。"},{"title":"The generation gap between parents and children has become a common topic of discussion. Write an essay analyzing the causes of this gap and suggesting ways to improve communication between generations.","cn":"父母与子女之间的代沟已成为常见的讨论话题。请写一篇文章分析代沟产生的原因，并建议改善代际沟通的方法。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段引出代沟现象","第二段分析代沟产生的原因","第三段提出改善沟通的建议"],"phrases":[{"en":"a widening gap between generations","cn":"日益扩大的代际差距"},{"en":"hold different values and beliefs","cn":"持有不同的价值观和信念"},{"en":"be influenced by different social environments","cn":"受到不同社会环境的影响"},{"en":"bridge the generation gap","cn":"弥合代沟"},{"en":"foster mutual understanding","cn":"增进相互理解"},{"en":"put oneself in another's shoes","cn":"换位思考"},{"en":"maintain open and honest communication","cn":"保持坦诚的沟通"},{"en":"respect each other's perspectives","cn":"尊重彼此的观点"}],"sents":["The generation gap has become an increasingly noticeable phenomenon in modern families.","It is natural that parents and children hold different values because they are influenced by different social environments.","To bridge the generation gap, it is essential for both sides to maintain open and honest communication.","Parents should try to put themselves in their children's shoes and understand the pressures they face.","Only by fostering mutual understanding and respect can we effectively narrow the gap between generations."],"essay":"The generation gap is a phenomenon that exists in virtually every society. In modern times, rapid social and technological changes have widened the differences between parents and their children in terms of values, lifestyle choices, and communication styles. Understanding the causes of this gap is the first step toward finding effective solutions.\n\nSeveral factors contribute to the generation gap. First, parents and children grow up in distinctly different social environments, which shapes their worldviews in different ways. Parents who experienced economic hardships tend to value stability and hard work, while their children, raised in an era of abundance and digital connectivity, may prioritize personal expression and work-life balance. Second, the rapid pace of technological development means that young people adapt to new tools and platforms much faster than their parents, creating a digital divide that further complicates communication. Third, differing expectations about career, marriage, and lifestyle often lead to conflicts between generations.\n\nTo bridge this gap, both sides need to make conscious efforts. Parents should try to put themselves in their children's shoes and understand the unique pressures of modern life. Children, in turn, should show patience and respect for their parents' experiences and wisdom. Regular family conversations and shared activities can foster mutual understanding. Ultimately, respecting each other's perspectives while maintaining open communication is the key to harmonious intergenerational relationships.","essayCn":"代沟是几乎每个社会都存在的现象。在现代社会，快速的社会和技术变革在价值观、生活方式选择和沟通风格方面扩大了父母与子女之间的差异。理解代沟的成因是找到有效解决方案的第一步。\n\n有几个因素导致了代沟的产生。首先，父母和子女在不同的社会环境中成长，这以不同的方式塑造了他们的世界观。经历过经济困难的父母倾向于重视稳定和勤奋工作，而在富裕和数字互联时代长大的子女可能更注重个人表达和工作与生活的平衡。其次，技术的快速发展意味着年轻人比父母更快适应新工具和平台，造成了进一步使沟通复杂化的数字鸿沟。第三，对职业、婚姻和生活方式的不同期望常常导致代际冲突。\n\n为了弥合这一差距，双方都需要做出有意识的努力。父母应该试着换位思考，理解现代生活的独特压力。反过来，子女应该对父母的经验和智慧表现出耐心和尊重。定期的家庭对话和共同活动可以增进相互理解。最终，在保持开放沟通的同时尊重彼此的观点是和谐代际关系的关键。"},{"title":"Teamwork is considered an essential quality in both academic settings and the workplace. Write an essay discussing the importance of teamwork and the qualities that make a good team member.","cn":"团队合作被认为是在学术环境和工作中都必不可少的素质。请写一篇文章讨论团队合作的重要性以及成为优秀团队成员所需的素质。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段阐述团队合作的重要性","第二段论述优秀团队成员应具备的品质","第三段总结并强调团队合作的价值"],"phrases":[{"en":"play an indispensable role in","cn":"在……中扮演不可或缺的角色"},{"en":"pool our talents and resources","cn":"汇集我们的才能和资源"},{"en":"demonstrate strong communication skills","cn":"展现出色的沟通技巧"},{"en":"show willingness to compromise","cn":"表现出妥协的意愿"},{"en":"take on responsibilities","cn":"承担责任"},{"en":"achieve a common goal","cn":"实现共同目标"},{"en":"resolve conflicts constructively","cn":"建设性地解决冲突"},{"en":"the collective effort of the team","cn":"团队的集体努力"}],"sents":["Teamwork plays an indispensable role in achieving success in both academic and professional settings.","By pooling our talents and resources, a team can accomplish far more than any individual working alone.","A good team member should demonstrate strong communication skills and a willingness to listen to others.","It is important to resolve conflicts constructively rather than avoiding them.","Through the collective effort of the team, even the most challenging tasks can be completed successfully."],"essay":"In today's interconnected world, teamwork has become an essential quality for success. Whether in academic group projects or professional collaborations, the ability to work effectively with others is highly valued. Teamwork enables individuals to pool their talents and resources, achieving results that would be impossible for any single person alone.\n\nThe importance of teamwork lies in its ability to bring together diverse perspectives and skills. When team members contribute their unique strengths, the group can solve complex problems more efficiently and creatively. Moreover, teamwork fosters a supportive environment where individuals learn from each other and grow together. However, effective teamwork depends on certain key qualities in each member. Good communication is perhaps the most important: team members must express their ideas clearly and listen to others with an open mind. Additionally, reliability and a strong sense of responsibility ensure that tasks are completed on time. A willingness to compromise and resolve conflicts constructively is equally crucial, as disagreements are inevitable in any group setting. Finally, a positive attitude and readiness to support fellow team members create a collaborative spirit that drives the team forward.\n\nIn conclusion, teamwork is far more than simply working alongside others; it requires active participation, mutual respect, and shared commitment. By cultivating these qualities, we can become better team members and achieve remarkable results through the collective effort of the team.","essayCn":"在当今互联互通的世界中，团队合作已成为成功的必备素质。无论是在学术小组项目还是职业协作中，与他人有效合作的能力都受到高度重视。团队合作使个人能够汇集才能和资源，取得任何个人单独工作无法实现的结果。\n\n团队合作的重要性在于它能够汇集多元的视角和技能。当团队成员贡献各自的独特优势时，团队能够更高效、更有创造性地解决复杂问题。此外，团队合作营造了一个支持性的环境，个人在其中互相学习、共同成长。然而，有效的团队合作取决于每个成员的某些关键品质。良好的沟通能力可能是最重要的：团队成员必须清楚地表达自己的想法，并以开放的心态倾听他人。此外，可靠性和强烈的责任感确保任务按时完成。妥协的意愿和建设性地解决冲突的能力同样重要，因为分歧在任何团队环境中都不可避免。最后，积极的态度和支持队友的意愿创造了推动团队前进的协作精神。\n\n总之，团队合作远不止是在他人旁边工作那么简单；它需要积极参与、相互尊重和共同的承诺。通过培养这些品质，我们可以成为更好的团队成员，通过团队的集体努力取得卓越成果。"},{"title":"Write a letter to the editor of a newspaper expressing your concern about food waste on campus and proposing practical solutions to address this problem.","cn":"请写一封信给报社编辑，表达你对校园食物浪费问题的关注，并提出切实可行的解决方案。","type":"应用文","tips":["第一段表明写信目的和问题的严重性","第二段分析浪费原因并提出解决方案","第三段呼吁行动并礼貌结尾"],"phrases":[{"en":"a serious issue that deserves attention","cn":"一个值得关注的问题"},{"en":"raise awareness of food conservation","cn":"提高节约粮食的意识"},{"en":"implement portion control measures","cn":"实施分量控制措施"},{"en":"launch a campus-wide campaign","cn":"发起全校范围的活动"},{"en":"reduce food waste significantly","cn":"显著减少食物浪费"},{"en":"promote the concept of","cn":"推广……的理念"},{"en":"make efficient use of resources","cn":"高效利用资源"},{"en":"I am writing to draw your attention to","cn":"我写信是想请您关注"}],"sents":["I am writing to draw your attention to the serious issue of food waste on our university campus.","It is estimated that a significant amount of food is thrown away in the campus canteens every day.","I would like to propose several practical measures to reduce food waste significantly.","By promoting the concept of food conservation, we can make efficient use of valuable resources.","I sincerely hope that my suggestions will be taken into serious consideration."],"essay":"Dear Editor,\n\nI am writing to draw your attention to a serious issue that deserves widespread concern: the alarming amount of food waste on our university campus. Every day, large quantities of edible food are thrown away in campus canteens, which not only represents a waste of valuable resources but also contradicts the values of thrift and sustainability that our society should uphold.\n\nSeveral factors contribute to this problem, including oversized portions, limited menu variety, and a general lack of awareness about food conservation. To address this issue, I would like to propose several practical solutions. First, the canteen should implement portion control measures, offering students the option to choose smaller servings at reduced prices. Second, the university should launch a campus-wide campaign to raise awareness of food waste through posters, lectures, and social media. Third, surplus food could be donated to local charities or food banks, ensuring that it reaches those in need rather than ending up in the trash.\n\nReducing food waste is a shared responsibility that requires the effort of every member of our campus community. I sincerely hope that through these measures, we can promote a culture of sustainability and make efficient use of resources. Thank you for your attention to this important matter.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essayCn":"尊敬的编辑：\n\n我写信是想请您关注一个值得广泛重视的严重问题：我们大学校园里令人震惊的食物浪费现象。每天都有大量可食用的食物在校园食堂被扔掉，这不仅是对宝贵资源的浪费，也与我们社会应该倡导的节俭和可持续发展价值观相矛盾。\n\n造成这一问题的因素有很多，包括分量过大、菜单品种有限以及普遍缺乏食物节约意识。为了解决这一问题，我想提出几个切实可行的方案。首先，食堂应实施分量控制措施，让学生可以选择较小的分量并享受优惠价格。其次，大学应发起全校范围的活动，通过海报、讲座和社交媒体来提高人们对食物浪费的认识。第三，剩余食物可以捐赠给当地慈善机构或食物银行，确保它们送到有需要的人手中，而不是被扔进垃圾桶。\n\n减少食物浪费是我们校园社区每个成员共同的责任。我真诚地希望，通过这些措施，我们能够推广可持续文化，高效利用资源。感谢您对这一重要问题的关注。\n\n此致敬意，\n李明"},{"title":"Social media has fundamentally changed the way people communicate and build relationships. Write an essay discussing whether social media has had a positive or negative impact on interpersonal relationships.","cn":"社交媒体从根本上改变了人们交流和建立关系的方式。请写一篇文章讨论社交媒体对人际关系产生了积极还是消极的影响。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段引出社交媒体对人际关系的影响","第二段辩证分析其正面和负面影响","第三段表明自己的立场并总结"],"phrases":[{"en":"reshape the way we interact","cn":"重塑我们的互动方式"},{"en":"maintain long-distance relationships","cn":"维系远距离关系"},{"en":"reduce face-to-face communication","cn":"减少面对面的交流"},{"en":"superficial connections","cn":"肤浅的社交联系"},{"en":"a sense of belonging","cn":"归属感"},{"en":"cyberbullying and online harassment","cn":"网络欺凌和网络骚扰"},{"en":"use social media wisely","cn":"明智地使用社交媒体"},{"en":"prioritize real-life interactions","cn":"优先考虑现实生活中的互动"}],"sents":["Social media has fundamentally reshaped the way we interact with others in the digital age.","While social media enables us to maintain long-distance relationships, it may also reduce the quality of face-to-face communication.","There is a growing concern that online connections tend to be more superficial than genuine friendships.","We should use social media wisely and prioritize real-life interactions with family and friends.","Only by finding a healthy balance between online and offline communication can we build truly meaningful relationships."],"essay":"Social media has fundamentally reshaped the way people communicate and maintain relationships. Platforms such as WeChat and Instagram have made it possible to connect with anyone around the world at any time. While this technological advancement has brought remarkable benefits, its impact on the quality of interpersonal relationships is a subject of ongoing debate.\n\nOn the positive side, social media makes it easier than ever to maintain long-distance relationships with friends and family members who live far away. It also provides a sense of belonging by connecting people with shared interests and creating online communities. Furthermore, social media can serve as a powerful tool for organizing events and spreading information quickly. On the negative side, however, excessive reliance on social media can reduce the quality of face-to-face communication. Many people spend so much time interacting online that they neglect the relationships right in front of them. Additionally, online connections tend to be more superficial, as curated profiles and brief messages cannot replace the depth of genuine, in-person conversations. There is also growing concern about cyberbullying and its harmful effects on mental health and relationships.\n\nIn my opinion, social media is neither entirely good nor entirely bad for relationships. The key is to use it wisely as a complement to, rather than a substitute for, real-life interactions. By prioritizing genuine connections and setting boundaries for online activity, we can enjoy the benefits of social media while nurturing truly meaningful relationships.","essayCn":"社交媒体从根本上重塑了人们交流和维持关系的方式。微信和Instagram等平台使人们能够随时与世界上任何人建立联系。虽然这项技术进步带来了显著的好处，但其对人际关系质量的影响仍是一个持续争论的话题。\n\n从积极方面来看，社交媒体使维系与远方亲友的远距离关系变得前所未有的便捷。它还通过将拥有共同兴趣的人联系起来并创建在线社区来提供归属感。此外，社交媒体可以作为组织活动和快速传播信息的有力工具。然而从消极方面来看，过度依赖社交媒体会降低面对面交流的质量。许多人花太多时间在线互动，以至于忽视了身边的关系。此外，网络联系往往更加肤浅，因为精心编辑的个人资料和简短的信息无法替代真实面对面交谈的深度。人们对网络欺凌及其对心理健康和关系的有害影响也日益担忧。\n\n在我看来，社交媒体对人际关系既非全然好也非全然坏。关键在于明智地使用它，作为现实生活互动的补充而非替代。通过优先考虑真实的联系并为在线活动设定界限，我们可以在享受社交媒体好处的同时培养真正有意义的人际关系。"},{"title":"Nowadays, many people choose to keep pets as companions. Write an essay discussing the benefits and responsibilities of pet ownership, and express your opinion on whether keeping pets is a positive trend.","cn":"如今，许多人选择养宠物作为伴侣。请写一篇文章讨论养宠物的益处和责任，并表达你对养宠物是否是积极趋势的看法。","type":"对比选择","tips":["第一段引出养宠物的现象","第二段分析养宠物的益处和应尽的责任","第三段给出个人看法和总结"],"phrases":[{"en":"provide emotional support and companionship","cn":"提供情感支持和陪伴"},{"en":"relieve stress and loneliness","cn":"缓解压力和孤独感"},{"en":"take on the responsibility of","cn":"承担……的责任"},{"en":"ensure proper care and nutrition","cn":"确保适当的照料和营养"},{"en":"make a long-term commitment","cn":"做出长期承诺"},{"en":"abandon pets due to impracticality","cn":"因不切实际而遗弃宠物"},{"en":"promote a sense of responsibility","cn":"培养责任感"},{"en":"a rewarding and meaningful experience","cn":"一种有意义且值得的经历"}],"sents":["Keeping pets has become an increasingly popular trend in modern society.","It is widely acknowledged that pets can provide emotional support and relieve stress for their owners.","However, pet owners must take on the responsibility of ensuring proper care and nutrition for their animals.","Before deciding to keep a pet, one should carefully consider whether they are ready to make a long-term commitment.","In my opinion, keeping pets is a rewarding experience as long as owners fulfill their responsibilities."],"essay":"In modern society, keeping pets has become an increasingly popular lifestyle choice. Dogs, cats, and even exotic animals are welcomed into millions of homes as beloved family members. While pet ownership offers significant benefits, it also comes with important responsibilities that should not be taken lightly.\n\nThe benefits of keeping pets are well documented. Studies have shown that pets can provide emotional support, reduce stress, and alleviate loneliness, particularly for elderly people and those living alone. Walking a dog regularly also encourages physical exercise, contributing to better overall health. For children, growing up with pets can promote a sense of responsibility and empathy. However, pet ownership is not without its challenges. Owners must ensure proper care and nutrition, provide regular veterinary check-ups, and invest time in training and socialization. Perhaps most importantly, keeping a pet is a long-term commitment that can last for many years. Unfortunately, some people abandon their pets when they find the responsibilities overwhelming, which causes great suffering to the animals and creates social problems.\n\nIn my opinion, keeping pets is a positive trend and a rewarding experience, but only when owners approach it with a serious sense of responsibility. Prospective pet owners should carefully evaluate their living conditions, financial situation, and time availability before making the decision. When treated with love and care, pets become invaluable companions that enrich our lives in countless ways.","essayCn":"在现代社会，养宠物已成为一种越来越流行的生活方式选择。狗、猫甚至异国动物作为心爱的家庭成员被数百万家庭接纳。虽然养宠物提供了显著的好处，但也伴随着不应被轻视的重要责任。\n\n养宠物的益处有据可查。研究表明，宠物能够提供情感支持、减轻压力和缓解孤独感，特别是对老年人和独居者而言。定期遛狗还能鼓励体育锻炼，有助于改善整体健康。对儿童来说，与宠物一起成长可以培养责任感和同理心。然而，养宠物也并非没有挑战。主人必须确保适当的照料和营养，提供定期兽医检查，并投入时间进行训练和社交化。也许最重要的是，养宠物是一项可以持续多年的长期承诺。不幸的是，一些人在发现责任难以承受时遗弃了宠物，这给动物造成了巨大痛苦并制造了社会问题。\n\n在我看来，养宠物是一种积极的趋势和值得的经历，但前提是主人以认真的责任感对待。潜在的宠物主人应在做决定之前仔细评估自己的居住条件、经济状况和可用时间。当受到爱心和照料时，宠物会成为无价的伴侣，以无数方式丰富我们的生活。"},{"title":"Write an essay about the impact of urbanization on people's quality of life. Discuss both the benefits and challenges that urbanization brings, and suggest ways to build better cities.","cn":"请写一篇关于城市化对人们生活质量影响的文章。讨论城市化带来的益处和挑战，并建议如何建设更美好的城市。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段描述城市化的趋势","第二段分析城市化的益处和挑战","第三段提出建设更好城市的建议"],"phrases":[{"en":"accelerate the process of urbanization","cn":"加速城市化进程"},{"en":"enjoy better infrastructure and services","cn":"享受更好的基础设施和服务"},{"en":"face rising living costs","cn":"面临不断上涨的生活成本"},{"en":"alleviate traffic congestion","cn":"缓解交通拥堵"},{"en":"promote sustainable urban development","cn":"促进可持续城市发展"},{"en":"expand green spaces","cn":"扩大绿地面积"},{"en":"improve public transportation systems","cn":"改善公共交通系统"},{"en":"enhance the overall quality of life","cn":"提高整体生活质量"}],"sents":["The acceleration of urbanization has become one of the most significant trends of the twenty-first century.","While urban residents enjoy better infrastructure and services, they also face rising living costs and environmental problems.","To build better cities, it is essential to improve public transportation systems and expand green spaces.","Sustainable urban development requires careful planning that balances economic growth with environmental protection.","By implementing effective policies, we can enhance the overall quality of life for all urban residents."],"essay":"Urbanization is one of the most defining trends of the twenty-first century. As more people migrate from rural areas to cities in search of better opportunities, urban populations continue to grow at an unprecedented rate. This rapid urbanization brings both remarkable benefits and serious challenges that affect people's quality of life.\n\nOn the one hand, cities offer superior infrastructure, including advanced healthcare facilities, diverse educational institutions, and abundant employment opportunities. Urban residents generally enjoy a higher standard of living with convenient access to cultural and recreational activities. On the other hand, rapid urbanization also creates significant challenges. Rising housing prices and living costs make it difficult for many residents to afford a comfortable life. Traffic congestion, air pollution, and noise are common problems in large cities. Furthermore, the destruction of green spaces and natural habitats in the name of development threatens the ecological balance and reduces the livability of urban areas.\n\nTo build better cities, governments should prioritize sustainable urban development. This includes investing in efficient public transportation systems to alleviate traffic congestion, expanding urban green spaces to improve air quality, and implementing affordable housing policies to reduce the financial burden on residents. Community participation should also be encouraged in urban planning decisions. By striking a balance between economic growth and environmental protection, we can create cities that truly enhance the quality of life for all inhabitants.","essayCn":"城市化是二十一世纪最具标志性的趋势之一。随着越来越多的人从农村迁移到城市寻找更好的机会，城市人口以前所未有的速度持续增长。这种快速的城市化既带来了显著的好处，也带来了影响人们生活质量的严峻挑战。\n\n一方面，城市拥有优越的基础设施，包括先进的医疗设施、多元化的教育机构和丰富的就业机会。城市居民通常享有更高的生活水平，可以便捷地获取文化和休闲活动。另一方面，快速城市化也带来了重大挑战。不断上涨的房价和生活成本使许多居民难以负担舒适的生活。交通拥堵、空气污染和噪音是大城市常见的问题。此外，以发展名义破坏绿地和自然栖息地威胁着生态平衡，降低了城市的宜居性。\n\n为了建设更美好的城市，政府应优先考虑可持续的城市发展。这包括投资高效的公共交通系统以缓解交通拥堵，扩大城市绿地以改善空气质量，以及实施经济适用房政策以减轻居民的经济负担。城市规划决策中也应鼓励社区参与。通过在经济增长与环境保护之间取得平衡，我们可以创造真正提高所有居民生活质量的城市。"},{"title":"In an era of information explosion, the ability to think critically is more important than ever. Write an essay discussing why critical thinking matters and how it can be cultivated in education.","cn":"在信息爆炸的时代，批判性思维能力比以往任何时候都更加重要。请写一篇文章讨论批判性思维为何重要以及如何在教育中培养它。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段阐述批判性思维在当代社会的重要性","第二段讨论批判性思维在教育中的培养方法","第三段总结其长远价值"],"phrases":[{"en":"distinguish fact from opinion","cn":"区分事实与观点"},{"en":"analyze information objectively","cn":"客观地分析信息"},{"en":"question assumptions and beliefs","cn":"质疑假设和信念"},{"en":"make informed decisions","cn":"做出明智的决定"},{"en":"encourage open-minded discussion","cn":"鼓励开放的讨论"},{"en":"be susceptible to misinformation","cn":"容易受到错误信息的影响"},{"en":"foster independent thinking","cn":"培养独立思考能力"},{"en":"an essential skill for the modern age","cn":"现代时代的基本技能"}],"sents":["In an era of information explosion, the ability to think critically has become an essential skill for the modern age.","Critical thinking enables individuals to analyze information objectively and distinguish fact from opinion.","Educators should create classroom environments that encourage open-minded discussion and the questioning of assumptions.","Without critical thinking, people are more susceptible to misinformation and manipulation.","Cultivating critical thinking in education is an investment that will benefit individuals and society for generations to come."],"essay":"We live in an age where information is abundant and easily accessible. From social media to news websites, we are constantly bombarded with data, opinions, and claims. In this context, the ability to think critically has become an essential skill that enables individuals to navigate the complex information landscape and make informed decisions.\n\nCritical thinking matters because it empowers people to analyze information objectively, distinguish fact from opinion, and evaluate the credibility of sources. Without this skill, individuals are more susceptible to misinformation, bias, and manipulation, which can lead to poor decision-making in both personal and professional life. In education, cultivating critical thinking should be a priority. Teachers can achieve this by designing lessons that require students to question assumptions, evaluate evidence, and construct well-reasoned arguments. Instead of relying solely on rote memorization, classrooms should encourage open-minded discussion and debate where diverse perspectives are valued. Project-based learning and case studies are also effective methods that challenge students to apply their analytical skills to real-world problems.\n\nIn conclusion, critical thinking is not merely an academic skill but a vital life competency that enables individuals to think independently and act responsibly. By prioritizing its cultivation in education, we prepare the next generation to face the challenges of an increasingly complex world with confidence and wisdom.","essayCn":"我们生活在一个信息丰富且易于获取的时代。从社交媒体到新闻网站，我们不断被数据、观点和声明所包围。在这样的背景下，批判性思维能力已成为一项基本技能，使个人能够在复杂的信息环境中导航并做出明智的决定。\n\n批判性思维之所以重要，是因为它使人们能够客观地分析信息、区分事实与观点，并评估信息来源的可信度。缺乏这项技能的人更容易受到错误信息、偏见和操纵的影响，这可能导致个人和职业生活中做出糟糕的决策。在教育中，培养批判性思维应当成为优先考虑的事项。教师可以通过设计需要学生质疑假设、评估证据和构建有理有据论点的课程来实现这一目标。课堂不应仅仅依赖死记硬背，而应鼓励开放的讨论和辩论，让多元观点受到重视。项目式学习和案例研究也是有效的方法，能挑战学生将分析技能应用于现实问题。\n\n总之，批判性思维不仅是一项学术技能，更是使个人能够独立思考和负责任地行动的重要生活能力。通过在教育中优先培养批判性思维，我们为下一代做好准备，以自信和智慧面对日益复杂世界的挑战。"},{"title":"Write a proposal letter to your university suggesting the establishment of a campus recycling program. Explain the reasons for your proposal and outline how it could be implemented.","cn":"请写一封建议信给你的大学，建议建立校园回收计划。说明提出建议的理由并概述实施方案。","type":"应用文","tips":["第一段说明写信目的和背景","第二段阐述建立回收计划的理由和实施方案","第三段表达期望并礼貌结尾"],"phrases":[{"en":"promote environmental sustainability on campus","cn":"促进校园环境的可持续发展"},{"en":"place clearly labeled recycling bins","cn":"放置标识清晰的回收箱"},{"en":"organize educational workshops","cn":"组织教育工作坊"},{"en":"reduce the amount of waste generated","cn":"减少产生的废物量"},{"en":"raise environmental awareness","cn":"提高环保意识"},{"en":"collaborate with student organizations","cn":"与学生组织合作"},{"en":"contribute to a greener campus","cn":"为建设绿色校园做贡献"},{"en":"I strongly recommend that","cn":"我强烈建议"}],"sents":["I am writing to propose the establishment of a comprehensive recycling program on our campus.","The implementation of such a program would significantly reduce the amount of waste generated on campus.","I strongly recommend that the university place clearly labeled recycling bins in strategic locations across the campus.","By collaborating with student organizations, the university can effectively raise environmental awareness among students.","I sincerely hope that my proposal will receive favorable consideration and lead to meaningful action."],"essay":"Dear University Administration,\n\nI am writing to propose the establishment of a comprehensive campus recycling program. As environmental sustainability becomes an increasingly important global priority, I believe our university has a responsibility to lead by example and take concrete steps to reduce waste and promote a greener campus.\n\nCurrently, a significant amount of recyclable materials such as paper, plastic bottles, and cans are mixed with general waste and sent to landfills. This not only wastes valuable resources but also harms the environment. To address this issue, I propose a three-step approach. First, the university should place clearly labeled recycling bins in all academic buildings, dormitories, and dining areas to make it convenient for students and staff to sort their waste. Second, the university should organize educational workshops and campaigns to raise environmental awareness and teach the campus community about proper recycling practices. Third, collaborating with local recycling companies would ensure that collected materials are properly processed and reused.\n\nI believe that implementing a campus recycling program would not only reduce the environmental impact of our university but also cultivate a sense of responsibility among students that will last a lifetime. I sincerely hope that this proposal will receive your favorable consideration.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Hua","essayCn":"尊敬的大学管理部门：\n\n我写信提议建立一个全面的校园回收计划。随着环境可持续发展日益成为重要的全球优先事项，我认为我们的大学有责任以身作则，采取切实步骤减少浪费并促进校园的绿色化。\n\n目前，大量可回收材料如纸张、塑料瓶和易拉罐与一般垃圾混合在一起被送往垃圾填埋场。这不仅浪费了宝贵的资源，还损害了环境。为了解决这一问题，我提出一个三步方案。首先，大学应在所有教学楼、宿舍和餐厅放置标识清晰的回收箱，方便师生分类投放垃圾。其次，大学应组织教育工作坊和宣传活动，提高环保意识并教社区成员正确的回收方法。第三，与当地回收公司合作可以确保收集的材料得到妥善处理和再利用。\n\n我相信，实施校园回收计划不仅能减少我们大学的环境影响，还将在学生中培养将持续终生的责任感。我真诚地希望此提案能得到您的积极考虑。\n\n此致敬意，\n李明"},{"title":"Some people believe that success is primarily the result of hard work, while others think luck plays a more important role. Write an essay expressing your view on what determines success.","cn":"有些人认为成功主要源于努力工作，而另一些人认为运气起着更重要的作用。请写一篇文章表达你对成功决定因素的看法。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段引出关于成功因素的讨论","第二段论述你的观点，可用多个论据支撑","第三段总结并升华主题"],"phrases":[{"en":"a combination of multiple factors","cn":"多种因素的组合"},{"en":"persevere in the face of adversity","cn":"在逆境中坚持不懈"},{"en":"seize opportunities when they arise","cn":"抓住出现的机会"},{"en":"lay the groundwork for","cn":"为……奠定基础"},{"en":"attribute success to","cn":"将成功归因于"},{"en":"a driving force behind","cn":"……背后的驱动力"},{"en":"prepare oneself thoroughly","cn":"做好充分的准备"},{"en":"the key to achieving success","cn":"取得成功的关键"}],"sents":["The question of what determines success has been debated for centuries.","While luck may present opportunities, it is hard work that lays the groundwork for lasting success.","Those who persevere in the face of adversity are more likely to seize opportunities when they arise.","In my opinion, success is a combination of preparation, persistence, and the ability to recognize opportunities.","Only by preparing oneself thoroughly can one truly take advantage of whatever luck may bring."],"essay":"The question of what determines success has fascinated people for generations. Some argue that relentless hard work is the primary driver of achievement, while others contend that luck plays a more decisive role. In my view, success is best understood as the result of multiple factors working together.\n\nHard work is undoubtedly a driving force behind most achievements. Through consistent effort, individuals develop skills, accumulate knowledge, and build the resilience needed to overcome obstacles. History is filled with examples of people who achieved remarkable success through years of dedication and perseverance. However, it would be naive to ignore the role of luck entirely. Being born into the right circumstances or encountering the right opportunity at the right time can certainly accelerate one's progress. That said, I believe that luck only favors those who are prepared. Without the foundation built through hard work, even the most fortunate opportunities would go to waste. Those who persevere in the face of adversity develop the ability to recognize and seize opportunities that others might overlook.\n\nIn conclusion, while luck can open doors, it is hard work and preparation that determine whether we can walk through them. Success is not a matter of choosing between effort and fortune; rather, it is the combination of both, with diligence serving as the foundation upon which lucky breaks can truly make a difference.","essayCn":"关于什么决定成功的问题让几代人都着迷。有些人认为不懈的努力是成就的主要驱动力，而另一些人则认为运气起着更具决定性的作用。在我看来，成功最好被理解为多种因素共同作用的结果。\n\n努力无疑是大多数成就背后的驱动力。通过持续的努力，个人发展技能、积累知识并建立克服逆境所需的韧性。历史上充满了通过多年奉献和坚持不懈取得卓越成功的人们的例子。然而，完全忽视运气的作用也是天真的。出生在合适的环境或在合适的时间遇到合适的机会确实可以加速一个人的进步。话虽如此，我相信运气只会眷顾有准备的人。没有通过努力打下的基础，即使是最幸运的机遇也会被浪费。在逆境中坚持不懈的人发展出了识别和抓住他人可能忽视的机会的能力。\n\n总之，虽然运气可以打开大门，但努力和准备决定了我们能否走进去。成功不是在选择努力和运气之间做抉择的问题；相反，它是两者的结合，其中勤奋是幸运机遇真正发挥作用的基础。"},{"title":"Write an essay about the role of traditional culture in modern society. Should we preserve traditional customs, or should we focus on embracing modernization? State your opinion clearly.","cn":"请写一篇关于传统文化在现代社会中作用的文章。我们应该保护传统习俗，还是应该专注于拥抱现代化？请清楚地表达你的观点。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段引出传统文化与现代化的关系","第二段论述你的立场，可举例说明","第三段总结并给出展望"],"phrases":[{"en":"an invaluable treasure of human civilization","cn":"人类文明的宝贵财富"},{"en":"preserve cultural heritage","cn":"保护文化遗产"},{"en":"embrace modernization","cn":"拥抱现代化"},{"en":"strike a balance between tradition and innovation","cn":"在传统与创新之间取得平衡"},{"en":"strengthen cultural identity","cn":"增强文化认同"},{"en":"adapt to the changing times","cn":"适应变化的时代"},{"en":"pass down from generation to generation","cn":"代代相传"},{"en":"coexist and complement each other","cn":"共存互补"}],"sents":["Traditional culture is an invaluable treasure of human civilization that deserves to be preserved and cherished.","It is possible for tradition and modernization to coexist and complement each other rather than conflict.","We should strike a balance between preserving cultural heritage and embracing modern development.","By adapting traditional customs to modern life, we can ensure their continued relevance for future generations.","Only by valuing both our cultural roots and modern progress can we build a truly enriched society."],"essay":"As globalization and modernization continue to reshape our world, the question of how to handle traditional culture has become increasingly relevant. Some people argue that we should wholeheartedly embrace modernization and leave outdated customs behind, while others insist that preserving traditional culture is essential. In my opinion, tradition and modernization should coexist and complement each other.\n\nTraditional culture represents an invaluable treasure of human civilization. Customs, festivals, art forms, and philosophical traditions carry the collective wisdom of our ancestors and strengthen our sense of cultural identity. When we celebrate traditional festivals or practice ancient art forms, we are not merely engaging in nostalgia; we are maintaining a vital connection to our roots that gives meaning and depth to our lives. Moreover, traditional values such as harmony, respect for elders, and community solidarity offer important guidance in today's fast-paced, individualistic society. However, this does not mean we should resist change. Modernization brings progress in science, technology, and social equality that greatly improves our quality of life. The key is to find a balance between preserving cultural heritage and adapting to the changing times.\n\nIn conclusion, we should not view tradition and modernization as opposing forces. Instead, we should strive to integrate the best of both worlds. By preserving meaningful traditions while embracing positive aspects of modernization, we can build a society that honors its past while confidently moving toward the future.","essayCn":"随着全球化和现代化持续重塑我们的世界，如何处理传统文化的问题变得越来越具有现实意义。有些人认为我们应该全心拥抱现代化，抛弃过时的习俗，而另一些人则坚持保护传统文化至关重要。在我看来，传统与现代化应该共存互补。\n\n传统文化是人类文明的宝贵财富。习俗、节日、艺术形式和哲学传统承载着祖先的集体智慧，增强了我们的文化认同感。当我们庆祝传统节日或练习古老的艺术形式时，我们不仅仅是在怀旧；我们正在维持与根源的重要联系，赋予我们的生活以意义和深度。此外，和谐、尊老和社群团结等传统价值观在当今快节奏的个人主义社会中提供了重要的指引。然而，这并不意味着我们应该抵制变革。现代化带来了科学、技术和社会平等的进步，极大地改善了我们的生活质量。关键在于在保护文化遗产和适应变化的时代之间找到平衡。\n\n总之，我们不应将传统和现代化视为对立的力量。相反，我们应该努力兼取两者之长。通过保护有意义的传统同时拥抱现代化的积极方面，我们可以建设一个既尊重过去又自信地迈向未来的社会。"},{"title":"Many young people today feel overwhelmed by the pressure to succeed. Write an essay discussing the sources of this pressure and how young people can cope with it effectively.","cn":"当今许多年轻人感到被成功的压力所压垮。请写一篇文章讨论这种压力的来源以及年轻人如何有效应对。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段描述年轻人面临压力的现象","第二段分析压力的主要来源","第三段提出有效的应对方法"],"phrases":[{"en":"under tremendous pressure to succeed","cn":"承受巨大的成功压力"},{"en":"high expectations from parents and society","cn":"来自父母和社会的高期望"},{"en":"compare themselves with others on social media","cn":"在社交媒体上与他人比较"},{"en":"develop effective coping strategies","cn":"开发有效的应对策略"},{"en":"maintain a healthy work-life balance","cn":"保持健康的工作与生活平衡"},{"en":"set realistic goals","cn":"设定现实的目标"},{"en":"seek support from friends and professionals","cn":"向朋友和专业人士寻求支持"},{"en":"define success on their own terms","cn":"按照自己的标准定义成功"}],"sents":["Many young people today find themselves under tremendous pressure to succeed in various aspects of life.","The sources of this pressure are diverse, ranging from high family expectations to the influence of social media.","To cope with this pressure effectively, young people should learn to set realistic goals and maintain a healthy balance.","It is important for young people to seek support from friends, family, and professionals when feeling overwhelmed.","By defining success on their own terms, young people can lead more fulfilling and less stressful lives."],"essay":"In contemporary society, an increasing number of young people report feeling overwhelmed by the pressure to succeed. Whether in academics, careers, or personal relationships, the expectation to achieve excellence seems inescapable. Understanding the sources of this pressure and learning to manage it effectively are crucial skills for young people today.\n\nThe pressure on young people comes from multiple sources. First, high expectations from parents and teachers can create an intense drive for academic achievement, leading many to feel that anything less than perfection is unacceptable. Second, social media amplifies this pressure by creating a culture of constant comparison, where carefully curated posts make others’ lives seem flawless. Third, the competitive job market adds another layer of pressure, as graduates struggle to secure positions that meet their aspirations and financial needs.\n\nTo cope with these pressures, young people should develop effective strategies. Setting realistic and achievable goals can help reduce the sense of being overwhelmed. It is also important to maintain a healthy work-life balance by making time for exercise, hobbies, and social activities. When the pressure becomes too much, seeking support from friends, family, or mental health professionals is a sign of strength, not weakness. Most importantly, young people should learn to define success on their own terms rather than conforming to external expectations, pursuing a path that brings genuine satisfaction.","essayCn":"在当代社会中，越来越多的年轻人报告说感到被成功的压力所压垮。无论是在学业、职业还是个人关系中，对卓越的期望似乎无处不在。了解这种压力的来源并学会有效管理它是当今年轻人的关键技能。\n\n年轻人面临的压力来自多个方面。首先，来自父母和老师的高期望可以产生对学业成就的强烈追求，使许多人觉得任何不够完美的表现都是不可接受的。其次，社交媒体通过创造持续攀比的文化放大了这种压力，精心编辑的帖子使他人的生活看起来完美无瑕。第三，竞争激烈的就业市场增加了另一层压力，因为毕业生们努力获得符合其抱负和经济需求的职位。\n\n为了应对这些压力，年轻人应制定有效的策略。设定现实可行的目标有助于减少不堪重负的感觉。通过为锻炼、爱好和社交活动留出时间来保持健康的工作与生活平衡也很重要。当压力过大时，向朋友、家人或心理健康专业人士寻求支持是力量的体现，而非软弱。最重要的是，年轻人应该学会按照自己的标准定义成功，而不是迎合外界的期望，追求一条带来真正满足感的道路。"},{"title":"Write an essay about the importance of protecting endangered species. What are the main threats to wildlife, and what measures should be taken to protect endangered animals?","cn":"请写一篇关于保护濒危物种重要性的文章。对野生动物主要有哪些威胁？应该采取什么措施来保护濒危动物？","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段阐述保护濒危物种的重要性","第二段分析主要威胁","第三段提出保护措施并总结"],"phrases":[{"en":"on the verge of extinction","cn":"濒临灭绝"},{"en":"habitat destruction and loss","cn":"栖息地的破坏和丧失"},{"en":"illegal hunting and trafficking","cn":"非法捕猎和贩卖"},{"en":"maintain ecological balance","cn":"维持生态平衡"},{"en":"establish nature reserves","cn":"建立自然保护区"},{"en":"strengthen law enforcement","cn":"加强执法力度"},{"en":"raise public awareness of","cn":"提高公众对……的认识"},{"en":"a shared responsibility of all humanity","cn":"全人类共同的责任"}],"sents":["The protection of endangered species is a shared responsibility of all humanity.","Habitat destruction and illegal hunting are among the most serious threats to wildlife.","It is imperative that we establish more nature reserves to provide safe habitats for endangered animals.","By strengthening law enforcement, we can effectively combat illegal wildlife trafficking.","Only through concerted global efforts can we ensure the survival of endangered species for future generations."],"essay":"The Earth is home to an incredible diversity of life, but many species are currently on the verge of extinction. The loss of any species is not only an irreversible tragedy for nature but also a threat to the ecological systems upon which human survival depends. Protecting endangered species is therefore a matter of urgent importance.\n\nThe main threats to wildlife are both numerous and severe. Habitat destruction is perhaps the most significant factor, as deforestation, urban expansion, and agricultural development continue to destroy the natural environments where animals live and breed. Illegal hunting and trafficking represent another devastating threat, driven by demand for products such as ivory, fur, and traditional medicines. Climate change further exacerbates these problems by altering ecosystems and disrupting food chains. When one species disappears, it can trigger a chain reaction affecting the entire ecosystem.\n\nTo address these threats, a comprehensive approach is needed. Governments should establish more nature reserves and wildlife corridors to provide safe habitats. Law enforcement must be strengthened to crack down on illegal hunting, with harsher penalties for violators. International cooperation is also essential, as many endangered species migrate across borders. Additionally, we should raise public awareness about biodiversity through education campaigns. Every individual can contribute by supporting conservation organizations. Protecting endangered species is a shared responsibility of all humanity, and the time to act is now.","essayCn":"地球是令人难以置信的生物多样性的家园，但许多物种目前正濒临灭绝。任何物种的丧失不仅是对自然的不可逆转的悲剧，也是对人类赖以生存的生态系统的威胁。因此，保护濒危物种是一件紧迫重要的事情。\n\n对野生动物的威胁既多又严重。栖息地破坏可能是最重要的因素，因为森林砍伐、城市扩张和农业发展持续破坏动物生活和繁殖的自然环境。非法捕猎和贩卖构成了另一个毁灭性的威胁，其驱动力来自对象牙、毛皮和传统药物等产品的需求。气候变化通过改变生态系统和扰乱食物链进一步加剧了这些问题。当一个物种消失时，它可能引发影响整个生态系统的连锁反应。\n\n为了应对这些威胁，需要一种综合性的方法。政府应建立更多的自然保护区和野生动物走廊，为濒危动物提供安全的栖息地。必须加强执法力度，打击非法捕猎，对违法者施以更严厉的惩罚。国际合作也至关重要，因为许多濒危物种跨越国界迁徙。此外，我们应该通过教育宣传提高公众对生物多样性的认识。每个人都可以通过支持保护组织来做出贡献。保护濒危物种是全人类共同的责任，现在就是行动的时刻。"},{"title":"Some people believe that failure is something to be ashamed of, while others see it as a valuable learning experience. Write an essay discussing the importance of learning from failure.","cn":"有些人认为失败是可耻的事情，而另一些人将其视为宝贵的学习经验。请写一篇文章讨论从失败中学习的重要性。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段引出对失败的不同态度","第二段论述失败为何是宝贵的学习机会","第三段总结并鼓励积极面对失败"],"phrases":[{"en":"be afraid of making mistakes","cn":"害怕犯错"},{"en":"a stepping stone to success","cn":"通向成功的垫脚石"},{"en":"learn valuable lessons from","cn":"从……中学到宝贵的教训"},{"en":"build resilience and perseverance","cn":"培养韧性和毅力"},{"en":"analyze the causes of failure","cn":"分析失败的原因"},{"en":"adopt a positive attitude toward","cn":"对……持积极态度"},{"en":"turn setbacks into opportunities","cn":"将挫折转化为机遇"},{"en":"an inevitable part of the journey","cn":"旅途中不可避免的一部分"}],"sents":["Failure is often regarded negatively, but it is in fact an inevitable part of the journey toward success.","By analyzing the causes of failure, we can learn valuable lessons that help us avoid repeating the same mistakes.","It is through overcoming setbacks that we build resilience and perseverance.","We should adopt a positive attitude toward failure and view it as a stepping stone to future achievements.","Those who learn to turn setbacks into opportunities are the ones who ultimately achieve lasting success."],"essay":"In a society that often celebrates success and perfection, failure is frequently viewed as something shameful. Many people go to great lengths to avoid failure, fearing the embarrassment it may bring. However, I firmly believe that failure is not the opposite of success but rather an essential part of it. Learning from failure is one of the most valuable experiences in life.\n\nFailure provides lessons that success simply cannot teach. When we fail, we are forced to examine our approaches, identify weaknesses, and think creatively about alternative solutions. This process of reflection builds critical thinking skills and resilience. Many of history’s greatest achievements were born from repeated failures. Thomas Edison famously conducted thousands of experiments before inventing the light bulb, and each failure brought him closer to understanding what worked. Similarly, in our own lives, every setback offers an opportunity for growth. When we adopt a positive attitude toward failure, we develop the courage to take risks and the perseverance to keep trying. This mindset shift transforms failure from a source of shame into a powerful catalyst for personal development.\n\nIn conclusion, failure is not something to be feared but embraced as an inevitable part of the journey to success. By learning from our failures, building resilience through setbacks, and turning obstacles into opportunities, we position ourselves for greater achievements. The truly successful are not those who never fail, but those who refuse to let failure define them.","essayCn":"在一个常常庆祝成功和完美的社会中，失败经常被视为可耻的事情。许多人竭尽全力避免失败，害怕它可能带来的尴尬。然而，我坚定地认为失败不是成功的对立面，而是成功的必要组成部分。从失败中学习是人生中最宝贵的经验之一。\n\n失败提供了成功无法教授的教训。当我们失败时，我们被迫审视自己的方法，找出弱点，并创造性地思考替代方案。这个反思的过程培养了批判性思维技能和韧性。历史上许多最伟大的成就都源于反复的失败。托马斯·爱迪生在进行数千次实验后才发明了灯泡，每一次失败都使他更接近了解什么有效。同样，在我们自己的生活中，每一次挫折都提供了成长的机会。当我们对失败持积极态度时，我们发展出承担风险的勇气和继续尝试的毅力。这种心态的转变将失败从耻辱的来源转变为个人发展的强大催化剂。\n\n总之，失败不是应该害怕的东西，而应被拥抱为通向成功旅途中不可避免的一部分。通过从失败中学习、通过挫折培养韧性并将障碍转化为机遇，我们为更大的成就做好准备。真正成功的人不是从不失败的人，而是那些拒绝让失败定义自己的人。"},{"title":"Write a report for your university newspaper about a recent volunteer activity organized by the student union. Include details about what was done, who participated, and the impact on the community.","cn":"请为你的大学校报写一篇关于学生会近期组织的志愿活动的报道。包括所做的事情、参与人员以及对社区的影响等细节。","type":"应用文","tips":["第一段概述活动的时间、地点和参与者","第二段描述活动具体内容和过程","第三段总结活动意义和影响"],"phrases":[{"en":"organize a volunteer activity","cn":"组织一次志愿活动"},{"en":"participate enthusiastically","cn":"热情参与"},{"en":"make a meaningful contribution to","cn":"为……做出有意义的贡献"},{"en":"raise awareness of","cn":"提高对……的意识"},{"en":"receive positive feedback from","cn":"收到来自……的积极反馈"},{"en":"demonstrate the spirit of","cn":"展现……的精神"},{"en":"strengthen the bond between","cn":"加强……之间的纽带"},{"en":"a resounding success","cn":"一次巨大的成功"}],"sents":["Last Saturday, the Student Union organized a volunteer activity that attracted over 100 enthusiastic participants.","The volunteers worked tirelessly to improve the living conditions of the local community.","The activity not only made a meaningful contribution to the community but also raised awareness of social responsibility among students.","Participants reported that the experience was both rewarding and eye-opening.","The event was widely regarded as a resounding success and received positive feedback from both participants and community members."],"essay":"Last Saturday, the Student Union organized a volunteer community service activity at Sunshine Neighborhood, a residential area on the outskirts of our city. The event attracted over 100 enthusiastic student volunteers who dedicated their time and energy to making a positive difference in the local community.\n\nThe activity consisted of several meaningful tasks. In the morning, groups of volunteers visited elderly residents living alone, helping them clean their apartments, read newspapers, and enjoy friendly conversations. Many of these elderly people expressed how much they appreciated the company and care from young people. Meanwhile, another team set up an educational booth in the community center, where they taught children basic English and mathematics through fun games and activities. In the afternoon, volunteers worked together to beautify the neighborhood by planting trees, cleaning public areas, and painting murals on blank walls. The colorful murals, designed by art students, depicted themes of harmony and environmental protection.\n\nThe activity was widely regarded as a resounding success. It not only made a meaningful contribution to the community but also strengthened the bond between university students and local residents. Participants reported that the experience was both rewarding and eye-opening, as it gave them a deeper understanding of social responsibility. The Student Union plans to organize similar events on a monthly basis, hoping to inspire more students to demonstrate the spirit of volunteerism and make a lasting impact on society.","essayCn":"上周六，学生会在位于我市郊区的阳光社区组织了一次志愿社区服务活动。该活动吸引了100多名热情的学生志愿者，他们投入时间和精力为当地社区带来积极的改变。\n\n活动包括几项有意义的任务。上午，几组志愿者探访了独居老人，帮助他们打扫公寓、读报纸，并进行友好的交谈。许多老人表示非常感激年轻人的陪伴和关心。与此同时，另一组志愿者在社区中心设立了教育摊位，通过有趣的游戏和活动教孩子们基础英语和数学。下午，志愿者们一起美化社区，种树、打扫公共区域，并在空白墙壁上绘制壁画。由艺术系学生设计的彩色壁画描绘了和谐与环保的主题。\n\n此次活动被广泛认为是一次巨大的成功。它不仅为社区做出了有意义的贡献，还加强了大学生与当地居民之间的联系。参与者表示，这次经历既充实又开阔眼界，因为它让他们对社会责任有了更深的理解。学生会计划每月组织类似的活动，希望激励更多学生展现志愿精神，对社会产生持久的影响。"},{"title":"The concept of work-life balance has gained increasing attention in recent years. Write an essay discussing why achieving work-life balance is important and how it can be attained.","cn":"近年来，工作与生活平衡的概念获得了越来越多的关注。请写一篇文章讨论为什么实现工作与生活平衡很重要以及如何实现它。","type":"观点论证","tips":["第一段引出工作与生活平衡的话题","第二段论述其重要性和实现方法","第三段总结并给出建议"],"phrases":[{"en":"achieve a healthy work-life balance","cn":"实现健康的工作与生活平衡"},{"en":"suffer from burnout and exhaustion","cn":"遭受倦怠和疲惫的困扰"},{"en":"allocate time and energy reasonably","cn":"合理分配时间和精力"},{"en":"set clear boundaries between work and personal life","cn":"在工作和个人生活之间设定明确的界限"},{"en":"prioritize physical and mental well-being","cn":"优先考虑身心健康"},{"en":"flexible working arrangements","cn":"灵活的工作安排"},{"en":"lead to higher job satisfaction","cn":"带来更高的工作满意度"},{"en":"a sustainable approach to work","cn":"一种可持续的工作方式"}],"sents":["In today's fast-paced society, achieving a healthy work-life balance has become increasingly important for people of all ages.","Those who fail to maintain a proper balance between work and life are more likely to suffer from burnout and exhaustion.","Companies should offer flexible working arrangements to help employees allocate time and energy reasonably.","By setting clear boundaries between work and personal life, individuals can prioritize their physical and mental well-being.","A sustainable approach to work ultimately leads to higher job satisfaction and overall happiness."],"essay":"In today's fast-paced and highly competitive world, the concept of work-life balance has gained significant attention. Many professionals find themselves working long hours, constantly checking emails, and struggling to find time for personal interests and relationships. This imbalance not only harms individual well-being but also reduces long-term productivity, making it a critical issue that deserves our attention.\n\nAchieving work-life balance is important for several reasons. First, it protects physical and mental health. People who overwork are more likely to suffer from burnout, stress-related illnesses, and strained relationships. Second, a balanced life actually enhances professional performance. When people have time to rest, pursue hobbies, and spend time with loved ones, they return to work with renewed energy and creativity. To achieve this balance, both individuals and organizations must take action. Individuals should set clear boundaries between work and personal life, such as designating specific hours for work and avoiding work-related tasks during personal time. Organizations should support their employees by offering flexible working arrangements, encouraging regular breaks, and fostering a culture that values well-being over excessive working hours.\n\nIn conclusion, work-life balance is not a luxury but a necessity for sustainable success and happiness. By prioritizing well-being and establishing healthy boundaries, we can lead more fulfilling lives both professionally and personally. It is time for society to recognize that a sustainable approach to work benefits everyone.","essayCn":"在当今快节奏、高度竞争的世界中，工作与生活平衡的概念获得了极大的关注。许多专业人士发现自己长时间工作、不断查看邮件、难以抽出时间满足个人兴趣和维持人际关系。这种失衡不仅损害个人健康，也降低了长期生产力，使其成为一个值得我们关注的关键问题。\n\n实现工作与生活平衡之所以重要，有几个原因。首先，它保护身心健康。过度工作的人更容易遭受倦怠、压力相关疾病和紧张的人际关系。其次，平衡的生活实际上能提升工作表现。当人们有时间休息、追求爱好和与爱人共度时光时，他们会以更新的精力和创造力回到工作中。为了实现这种平衡，个人和组织都必须采取行动。个人应在工作和个人生活之间设定明确的界限，例如规定特定的工作时间并避免在个人时间处理工作事务。组织应通过提供灵活的工作安排、鼓励定期休息和培养重视健康而非过度加班的文化来支持员工。\n\n总之，工作与生活平衡不是奢侈品，而是可持续成功和幸福的必需品。通过优先考虑健康和建立健康的界限，我们可以在职业和个人生活中都过上更充实的生活。现在是社会认识到可持续的工作方式对所有人都有益的时候了。"},{"title":"Some people think that universities should focus primarily on teaching practical job skills, while others believe that the purpose of university education is broader. Write an essay discussing the true purpose of higher education.","cn":"有些人认为大学应该主要教授实用的工作技能，而另一些人认为大学教育的目的更为广泛。请写一篇文章讨论高等教育的真正目的。","type":"对比选择","tips":["第一段引出大学教育目的的争议","第二段对比分析两种观点","第三段给出自己的观点"],"phrases":[{"en":"equip students with practical skills","cn":"让学生具备实用技能"},{"en":"cultivate well-rounded individuals","cn":"培养全面发展的人"},{"en":"broaden intellectual horizons","cn":"拓宽知识视野"},{"en":"enhance employability","cn":"增强就业能力"},{"en":"foster critical thinking and creativity","cn":"培养批判性思维和创造力"},{"en":"prepare students for life, not just careers","cn":"为学生的生活而不仅是职业做准备"},{"en":"a place for intellectual exploration","cn":"一个知识探索的场所"},{"en":"serve the long-term development of society","cn":"服务于社会的长期发展"}],"sents":["The true purpose of higher education has been a subject of ongoing debate in recent years.","While equipping students with practical skills is important, universities should also cultivate well-rounded individuals.","Higher education should broaden students' intellectual horizons and foster critical thinking and creativity.","Universities should prepare students for life, not just careers, by providing a comprehensive educational experience.","Only by combining practical training with intellectual development can higher education truly serve the long-term development of society."],"essay":"The purpose of higher education has been a subject of ongoing debate. Some argue that universities should focus primarily on teaching practical job skills to enhance graduates’ employability. Others believe that the mission of universities extends far beyond vocational training, aiming instead to cultivate well-rounded individuals capable of critical thinking and lifelong learning.\n\nThose who advocate for practical skill training have a valid point. In an increasingly competitive job market, graduates need specific competencies to secure employment and contribute to economic development. Programs in engineering and medicine, for example, require rigorous practical training that directly prepares students for their careers. However, reducing higher education to mere job training would be a grave mistake. Universities have traditionally been places for intellectual exploration, where students learn to think independently, question assumptions, and engage with complex ideas across disciplines. The study of humanities and sciences broadens intellectual horizons and fosters the creativity and adaptability essential in any career. Moreover, university life provides opportunities for personal growth and social engagement that extend far beyond the classroom.\n\nIn my view, the true purpose of higher education is to prepare students for life, not just careers. Universities should strike a balance between practical skill development and intellectual cultivation, producing graduates who are not only employable but also thoughtful, responsible citizens who can serve the long-term development of society.","essayCn":"高等教育的目的一直是一个持续争论的话题。有些人认为大学应该主要教授实用的工作技能以增强毕业生的就业能力。另一些人认为大学的使命远不止职业培训，而是培养能够批判性思考和终身学习的全面发展的人。\n\n主张实用技能培训的人有他们的道理。在日益激烈的就业市场中，毕业生需要具备特定的能力来获得工作并为经济发展做出贡献。例如，工程和医学等领域的项目需要严格的实践培训，直接为学生的职业生涯做准备。然而，将高等教育简化为纯粹的职业培训将是一个严重的错误。大学传统上是知识探索的场所，学生在那里学会独立思考、质疑假设并跨学科参与复杂的思想。人文学科和科学的学习拓宽了知识视野，培养了在任何职业中都必不可少的创造力和适应性。此外，大学生活提供了课堂之外的个人成长和社会参与的机会。\n\n在我看来，高等教育的真正目的是为学生的生活做准备，而不仅是为职业。大学应该在实用技能培养和知识素养培育之间取得平衡，培养出不仅具有就业能力，而且是有思想、负责任的公民，能够服务于社会的长期发展。"},{"title":"Write an essay about the influence of celebrity culture on young people. Do celebrities have a positive or negative impact on youth, and what responsibilities should they bear as public figures?","cn":"请写一篇关于名人文化对年轻人影响的文章。名人对青年产生了积极还是消极的影响？作为公众人物，他们应承担什么责任？","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段描述名人文化对年轻人的影响","第二段辩证分析正面和负面影响","第三段讨论名人应承担的责任并总结"],"phrases":[{"en":"exert a profound influence on","cn":"对……产生深远的影响"},{"en":"set an example for","cn":"为……树立榜样"},{"en":"promote positive values","cn":"传播积极的价值观"},{"en":"pursue superficial standards of beauty and success","cn":"追求肤浅的美丽和成功标准"},{"en":"be influenced by the media","cn":"受媒体影响"},{"en":"bear social responsibility","cn":"承担社会责任"},{"en":"use their platform to","cn":"利用他们的平台来"},{"en":"guide young people in the right direction","cn":"引导年轻人走向正确的方向"}],"sents":["Celebrity culture exerts a profound influence on young people in today's media-driven society.","While some celebrities use their platform to promote positive values, others may encourage superficial standards.","As public figures, celebrities should bear social responsibility and guide young people in the right direction.","Young people need to develop critical thinking to distinguish between positive and negative influences from celebrities.","It is essential that celebrities use their influence wisely and serve as positive role models for the younger generation."],"essay":"Celebrity culture has become a dominant force in modern media, and its influence on young people cannot be overlooked. From social media influencers to entertainment stars, celebrities shape the values and aspirations of millions of young followers. While this influence can be positive, it also raises concerns about the responsibilities that come with fame.\n\nOn the positive side, many celebrities use their platform to promote positive values and inspire young people. Some athletes demonstrate the importance of hard work and perseverance, while musicians use their fame to raise awareness about social issues such as poverty and environmental protection. These role models can motivate young people to pursue their dreams. However, celebrity culture also has a negative side. The constant exposure to carefully curated images of wealth and glamour can lead young people to pursue superficial standards and develop unrealistic expectations about life. Some celebrities engage in controversial behavior that may normalize harmful habits such as excessive spending or unhealthy body standards. Young people heavily influenced by the media may struggle to form their own values independent of celebrity influence.\n\nGiven their enormous impact on youth, celebrities should bear social responsibility for their actions and public image. By using their influence wisely and promoting positive messages, they can serve as powerful agents of change. At the same time, young people need to develop critical thinking to evaluate celebrity influence thoughtfully rather than blindly following trends.","essayCn":"名人文化已成为现代媒体中的一股主导力量，它对年轻人的影响不容忽视。从社交媒体影响者到娱乐明星，名人塑造了数百万年轻追随者的价值观和愿望。虽然这种影响可以是积极的，但也引发了关于名声所带来的责任的担忧。\n\n从积极方面来看，许多名人利用他们的平台推广积极价值观并激励年轻人。一些运动员展示了努力和毅力的重要性，而音乐家则利用他们的名气提高人们对贫困和环境保护等社会问题的认识。这些榜样可以激励年轻人追求梦想。然而，名人文化也有消极的一面。不断接触到精心修饰的财富和魅力画面可能导致年轻人追求肤浅的标准，对生活产生不切实际的期望。一些名人参与争议性行为，可能会使过度消费或不健康的身体标准等有害习惯正常化。深受媒体影响的年轻人可能难以独立于名人影响形成自己的价值观。\n\n鉴于他们对年轻人的巨大影响，名人应该为自己的行为和公众形象承担社会责任。通过明智地利用影响力并传播积极信息，他们可以成为推动变革的强大力量。同时，年轻人需要培养批判性思维来审慎地评估名人的影响，而不是盲目追随潮流。"},{"title":"In recent years, cross-cultural communication has become increasingly common due to globalization. Write an essay discussing the challenges and benefits of cross-cultural exchange, and how young people can improve their cross-cultural communication skills.","cn":"近年来，由于全球化，跨文化沟通变得越来越普遍。请写一篇文章讨论跨文化交流的挑战和益处，以及年轻人如何提高跨文化沟通能力。","type":"现象分析","tips":["第一段引出全球化背景下跨文化交流的趋势","第二段分析挑战与益处","第三段提出年轻人提高跨文化能力的建议"],"phrases":[{"en":"bridge cultural divides","cn":"弥合文化鸿沟"},{"en":"overcome language barriers","cn":"克服语言障碍"},{"en":"broaden one's cultural horizons","cn":"拓宽文化视野"},{"en":"foster mutual respect and understanding","cn":"培养相互尊重和理解"},{"en":"be exposed to diverse cultures","cn":"接触多元文化"},{"en":"avoid cultural stereotypes","cn":"避免文化刻板印象"},{"en":"develop intercultural competence","cn":"发展跨文化能力"},{"en":"embrace cultural diversity","cn":"拥抱文化多样性"}],"sents":["In the context of globalization, cross-cultural communication has become an increasingly important skill.","While language barriers and cultural differences pose challenges, cross-cultural exchange brings tremendous benefits.","Young people should actively seek opportunities to be exposed to diverse cultures and broaden their horizons.","By avoiding cultural stereotypes and maintaining an open mind, we can foster mutual respect and understanding.","Developing intercultural competence is essential for young people to thrive in today's interconnected world."],"essay":"Globalization has made cross-cultural communication an everyday reality. Whether through international study programs, online interactions, or multinational workplaces, people from different cultural backgrounds are connecting more frequently than ever before. While this trend presents exciting opportunities, it also poses unique challenges that require thoughtful navigation.\n\nCross-cultural exchange offers numerous benefits. It broadens our cultural horizons, exposes us to different ways of thinking, and fosters mutual respect and understanding. Through interacting with people from different backgrounds, we can challenge our assumptions and develop a more nuanced worldview. Businesses also benefit greatly, as diverse teams often produce more creative solutions. However, cross-cultural communication is not without its difficulties. Language barriers can lead to misunderstandings, and deeply ingrained cultural differences in communication styles, values, and social norms may cause unintended offense. Cultural stereotypes and prejudices can further hinder meaningful exchange, creating invisible walls between people.\n\nTo overcome these challenges, young people should actively develop their intercultural competence. Learning foreign languages is a practical first step, but equally important is cultivating cultural sensitivity and an open mindset. Participating in exchange programs, attending cultural events, and engaging with people from different backgrounds can provide firsthand experience that breaks down stereotypes. Most importantly, we should approach every cross-cultural interaction with curiosity, patience, and a genuine desire to understand. By embracing cultural diversity, young people can become effective global citizens who contribute to a more harmonious and connected world.","essayCn":"全球化使跨文化沟通成为日常现实。无论是通过国际留学项目、在线互动还是跨国工作场所，来自不同文化背景的人们比以往任何时候都更频繁地交流。虽然这一趋势提供了令人兴奋的机会，但也带来了需要用心应对的独特挑战。\n\n跨文化交流提供了诸多益处。它拓宽了我们的文化视野，让我们接触到不同的思维方式，并培养相互尊重和理解。通过与不同背景的人互动，我们可以挑战自己的假设，发展出更细致的世界观。企业也从中获益良多，因为多元化的团队往往能产生更具创造性的解决方案。然而，跨文化交流也并非没有困难。语言障碍可能导致误解，而根深蒂固的沟通风格、价值观和社会规范方面的文化差异可能无意间冒犯他人。文化刻板印象和偏见还可能阻碍有意义的交流，在人们之间制造无形的壁垒。\n\n为了克服这些挑战，年轻人应积极发展自己的跨文化能力。学习外语是务实的第一步，但同样重要的是培养文化敏感性和开放的心态。参加交流项目、出席文化活动以及与不同背景的人交往可以提供打破刻板印象的第一手经验。最重要的是，我们应该以好奇心、耐心和真正理解对方的愿望来对待每一次跨文化互动。通过拥抱文化多样性，年轻人可以成为有效的全球公民，为更加和谐互联的世界做出贡献。"}];